  <para style="h">Roma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Roma bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Roma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt1">Roma bi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kɛ ya ha Kristo Asafo nɛ ngɛ Roma a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Ye suɔli ngɛ Roma, ami Paulo, Yesu Kristo sɔmɔlɔ kɛ Tsɔɔlɔ nɛ a hla kaa e pee Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛlɔ ɔ, nɛ ngɛ nyɛ Roma nyɛmi ɔmɛ womi nɛ ɔ ngmae.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Mawu gbali ɔmɛ wo kikɛmɛ a Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ he si kɛ je blema ngɛ Somi Momo ɔ mi. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ kɔɔ e Bi, wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo, nɔ nɛ a fɔ lɛ nɔmlɔ adesa kɛ wo Matsɛ David weku ɔ mi ɔ he. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Nɛ akɛnɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje he je ɔ, a ngɔ lɛ kaa lɛ ji Mawu Bi pe kulaa, nɛ a naa Mawu klɔuklɔu nɛ e ji ɔ ngɛ e he.<verse eid="ROM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Nɛ kɛ gu Kristo nɔ ɔ, wɔ yayami peeli po wa nine su Mawu dloomi babauu nɔ. Jehanɛ ɔ, e ngɛ wɔ tsɔe nɛ wa ya ye e he odase kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he konɛ a le níhi agbohi nɛ e pee ha mɛ ɔ nɛ mɛ hu a he e nɔ nɛ a ye nɛ a bu lɛ tue.<verse eid="ROM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli ngɛ Roma, nyɛ hu nyɛ piɛ nihi nɛ e suɔ mɛ ɔ a he. Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Yesu Kristo ngɛ nyɛ hu tsɛe nɛ nyɛ ba pee Mawu bimɛ kɛ e nihi klɔuklɔuhi ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Yesu Kristo, wa Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu nɔ hemi kɛ yemi haa wami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Kekleekle ɔ, i gu Yesu nɔ kɛ ngɛ Mawu si nae ngɛ nyɛ he, ejakaa a le nɛ a tuɔ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he munyu kpakpa ngɛ je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he nɛ i ya. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Mawu nitsɛ le bɔ nɛ i sɔleɔ haa nyɛ, nɛ i kpaa pɛɛ ngɛ nyɛ kɛ nyɛ hiami níhi a he nyɔ kɛ pia kɛ haa nɔ nɛ i sɔmɔɔ kɛ ye he wami kulaa a, nɛ i fiɛɔ e Bi ɔ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nihi.<verse eid="ROM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Nɔ́ kake he nɛ i sɔleɔ ngɛ daa ji, ke Mawu maa suɔ ɔ, ma na he blɔ nɛ ma ba nyɛ ngɔ kɛ manye. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ejakaa ye hɛ jaa ngɛ nyɛ he. Nɛ ma suɔ nɛ ma ba nyɛ ngɔ nɛ ma ngɔ mumi dloomi nike ni ɔmɛ eko nɛ maa ye kɛ bua asafo ɔ kɛ pi si ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ kɛ ba ha nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Ma suɔ nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua mi, ejakaa tsa pi ye hemi kɛ yemi ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ i ngɛ hlae nɛ ma kɛ ha nyɛ, se mohu ma na he wami womi kɛ je nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ maa pee gbaami kɛ ha wɔ tsuo.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Anyɛmimɛ, i ngɛ hae nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa behi babauu nɛ be ɔ, a tsi ye nya, se jinɛ i to kaa ma ba nyɛ ngɔ nɛ ma ba tsu ni ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti nɛ ma kɛ hyɛ ha kaa i ma na yiblii kpakpa komɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ i na ngɛ ma jeli ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ lo. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ejakaa i hɛɛ nyɛ kɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ hiɔ, nihi nɛ a hɛ mi tsɔ kɛ nihi nɛ a hɛ mi tsɔ we, kɛ womi mi leli kɛ nihi nɛ a li womi mi tsuo. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, kaa e je imi nɔ kake ye he jinɛ i pee klaalo nɛ ma ba nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ Roma nɛ ma ba fiɛ Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Ejakaa Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ he pee we mi zo, ejakaa e ji Mawu blɔ nya tomi agbo nɛ e ma kɛ he nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ yeɔ ɔ, e yi wami. A fiɛ Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ pɛ kekle; se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ tsɛe nɛ e ba Mawu ngɔ kɛ gu kikɛmɛ a blɔ kake too ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ deɔ wɔ ke Mawu dla wɔ kɛ ha hiɔwe, nɛ e peeɔ wɔ dali ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ke wa he Kristo nɔ ye kaa e ma he wa yi wami. Mawu dami ɔ jeɔ e he kpo ke wa hemi kɛ yemi ɔ pi si kɛ je sisije kɛ ya su nyagbe, kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ ye he odase nɛ e de ke, “Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ heɔ Mawu nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e yi ma na wami” ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tue gbomi kɛ gbenɔ baa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Se Mawu abofu jeɔ hiɔwe kɛ baa yayami peeli nɛ tsiɔ anɔkuale ɔ blɔ ɔ a nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ejakaa a leɔ Mawu he anɔkuale munyu ɔ nɛ pi nɔ ko nɛ tsɔɔ mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ejakaa a naa hiɔwe kɛ zugba kɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ Mawu bɔ ɔ, nɛ kɛ je blema bebeebe nɛ a na le kaa Mawu ngɛ, nɛ e ngɛ neneene he wami. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a be nya jemi ko ngɛ nyagbe kojomi ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Nɛ e ji anɔkuale kaa a le kaa Mawu ngɛ mohu se a kplɛɛ we nɔ, nɛ a ja we lɛ, nɛ a nɛ lɛ si hulɔ kaa nɔ ko nɛ baa a yi daa. A peeɔ e he juɛmi yaya nɛ a susuɔ e he kaa mɛnɔ ji lɛ, nɛ mɛni e ngɛ hlae nɛ a pee ha lɛ. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a kuasia juɛmi ɔmɛ wo diblii kanikani nɛ a lu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />A tsɛɔ a he ni leli, se akɛnɛ a li Mawu ɔ, kuasiahi mohu ji mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Nɛ ngɛ anunyami kɛ neneene Mawu ɔ mohu nɛ a ma ja a nane mi ɔ, a jaa wɔhi nɛ ji tɛhi kɛ tsohi nɛ a hlɔ kaa nimli kɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi kɛ lohwe nane eywiɛtsɛhi kɛ sinɔhi.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu ngmɛɛ a he ngɛ konɛ a bɔ ajuama nɛ a pee yakayaka ni nɛ a tsui suɔ kɛ gbe mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he guɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />A le nɔ nɛ ji Mawu he nile anɔkuale ɔ, se mohu a heɔ nɔ́ nɛ ji lakpa munyu yeɔ. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a jaa nihi nɛ Mawu bɔ ɔ, nɛ a bui neneene Mawu ɔ nɛ bɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ mohu tue.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu ngmɛɛ a he ngɛ nɛ a di yakayaka nihi a se; nɛ a yi ɔmɛ bɔ ajuama kɛ gbe Mawu adebɔ he guɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ja a nɔuu nɛ nyumu ɔmɛ hu a ke yihi na we bɔmi se mohu a kɛ a he pee yakayaka nihi nɛ a na he hiɔwo nɔ nɛ sa mɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Akɛnɛ a kua Mawu, nɛ a bui tue ɔ, lɛ hu e ngmɛɛ a he nɛ a pee yakayaka níhi nɛ a tsui suɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />A pee yi kpɛti wami kɛ yayami slɔɔtohi, kaa hɛ kɔmi kɛ nyɛmi, nɔmlɔ gbemi kɛ pɛmi, lakpa yemi kɛ mi mi doomi. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />A pee a he nɔ he munyu yaya tuli, sieku yeli kɛ nihi nɛ a sume Mawu, nɔ buili, he tsɔɔli, fiali kɛ nɔ́ yaya he ga toli kɛ nihi nɛ a bui a fɔli. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Nihi nɛ nui nɔ́ sisi, nihi nɛ yi si womi nɔ, kɛ nihi nɛ be suɔmi nɛ a nɛ mɔbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />A le Mawu mlaa a, kaa nihi nɛ peeɔ kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, a sa gbenɔ. Se kɛ ɔ, mɛ nitsɛmɛ a peeɔ, nɛ a woɔ nihi nɛ peeɔ kikɛmɛ a nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ hu he wami.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hwɔɔ se tue gblami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Niinɛ, nyɛ ma de ke, “Nimli nɛ a he ngɛ gbeye a he munyu nɛ o ngɛ tue ji nɛ ɔ nɛ!” Se nyɛ hu ja a nɔuu nɛ nyɛ ngɛ. Ke ji nyɛ ke a yi mi wa nɛ e sa kaa a gblaa a tue ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kojoe, ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ nɔuu nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ peeɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Nɛ wa le klɛdɛɛ kaa Mawu maa bu nihi nɛ peeɔ kikɛmɛ a tɔmi ni nɛ ɔmɛ fɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Anɛ nyɛ susuu kaa Mawu maa ngmɛɛ nyɛ he nɛ e bu nihi nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ peeɔ kikɛmɛ a tɔmi nɛ ɔmɛ nɔuu fɔ lo? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Aloo nyɛ li kaa Mawu na nyɛ he tsui, nɛ e ngɛ nyɛ blɔ hyɛe nɛ nyɛɛ kpale ngɛ nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ a se kɛ ba e ngɔ?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Se akɛnɛ nyɛ tsui ti he je ɔ, nyɛ bui tue, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ Mawu kojomi ɔ blɔ hyɛe, ejakaa nyɛ kpa we yayami peemi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, abofu be ma nɛ Mawu maa kojo je ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Nɛ e maa wo nɔ tsuaa nɔ hiɔ ngɛ e ni tsumi he. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ peeɔ Mawu suɔmi nya ni kɛ tsui si tomi, nɛ e hlaa e anunyami kɛ bumi kɛ wami nɛ be nyagbe ɔ se blɔ ɔ, e ma ha lɛ neneene wami.<verse eid="ROM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Se e ma na nihi nɛ teɔ si kɛ siɔ Mawu anɔkuale ɔ, nɛ a peeɔ yayami ɔ a he abofu. E maa bu mɛ fɔ nɛ e maa gbla a tue wawɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Yuda bi kɛ ma je li tsuo nɛ ngmɛɛ we yayami he ɔ, a maa na amanehlu nɛ a maa na nɔ <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Se Yuda bi kɛ ma je li tsuo nɛ buɔ lɛ tue nɛ a peeɔ kpakpa a, a nine maa su Mawu anunyami kɛ he jɔmi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ejakaa Mawu hlɛ nɔ ko mi.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Nihi nɛ li mlaa a nɛ a peeɔ yayami ɔ, mɛ hu a hɛ mi ma kpata. Nɛ a maa ngɔ mlaa a kɛ kojo nihi nɛ le mlaa a se a peeɔ yayami ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ejakaa tsa pi mlaa a leli ji nihi nɛ peeɔ dali ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, se mohu nihi nɛ yeɔ mlaa a nɔ, nɛ mɛ ji nihi nɛ a maa bu dali. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ke wɔ jali nɛ li mlaa a se a he nile haa a tsuɔ mlaa a nya níhi ɔ, e ngɛ mi kaa a li mlaa a mohu, se mɛ nitsɛmɛ a plɛ mlaa kɛ ha a he. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Ejakaa a je mi bami tsɔɔ kaa a ngma nɔ́ nɛ mlaa a ngɛ hlae ɔ ngɛ a tsui mi. A le kpakpa kɛ yayami nɛ a he nile kojoɔ mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Nɛ be ma nɛ Mawu maa gu Yesu Kristo nɔ kɛ kojo nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ laami sanehi kɛ ni peemi níhi a he; nɛ enɛ ɔ piɛ Mawu blɔ nya tomi agbo ɔ nɛ i de nyɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Nyɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nyɛ susuu kaa nyɛɛ kɛ Mawu kpɛti ngɛ saminya, ejakaa nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ hɛ fɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ kɛ ha nyɛ yi wami hemi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ nyɛ fiaa kaa e huɛmɛ ji nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />E ji anɔkuale kaa nyɛ le nɔ́ nɛ e ngɛ hlae ngɛ nyɛ dɛ, nɛ nyɛ le nɔ́ nɛ da kɛ nɔ́ nɛ dɛ. Ejakaa a tsɔɔ nyɛ e mlaa amɛ kɛ je nyɛ jokuɛwi a si. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Nyɛ le nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ tsɔɔ hɛ yuyuilɔ tete Mawu ngɔ blɔ; nɛ nyɛ ngɔɔ nyɛ he kaa kane nɛ maa tsɔɔ nihi nɛ laa ngɛ diblii mi ɔ Mawu ngɔ blɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />E peeɔ nyɛ kaa nyɛ ma nyɛ kpaka nihi nɛ li nɔ́ ko, nɛ nyɛ maa tsɔɔ jokuɛwi tete Mawu he nile, ejakaa nyɛ lɛɛ mlaa amɛ nɛ a ji nile kɛ anɔkuale sɔuu.<verse eid="ROM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ tsɔɔ we nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ he ni se nyɛ tsɔɔ ni kpahi Mawu se blɔ ɔ? Nyɛ deɔ ni kpahi ke a ko ju, anɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ju we lo? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Nyɛ deɔ ke a ko bɔ ajuama, anɛ nyɛ bɔɛ ajuama lo? Ja a nɔuu nɛ nyɛ deɔ ke, “A ko ja wɔ,” se nyɛɛ kɛ sika peeɔ nyɛ Mawu.<verse eid="ROM 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Nyɛ fiaa kaa nyɛ le Mawu mlaa amɛ, se nyɛ gbee Mawu he guɛ, ejakaa nyɛ tɔɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Nyɛ tɔmi ɔmɛ a he je nɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ deɔ ke je ɔ tuɔ musu bɔmi munyu kɛ siɔ Mawu ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke Yuda no ji mo nɛ o yeɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ o he ngɛ se nami; se ke o gboɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ tue ɔ lɛɛ o hí pi wɔ jalɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Nɛ ke wɔ jali yeɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, anɛ e sɛ kaa e haa mɛ blɔ nya kɛ anunyami nɛ e to kɛ ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ lo? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Niinɛ, e maa hi ha wɔ jali ɔmɛ pe nyɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ le Mawu he ni kɛ e si womi ɔmɛ nɛ e wo nyɛ ɔ se nyɛ yi e mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ejakaa tsa pi Yuda bi kpakpahi ji nyɛ, ejakaa tsa pi Yuda fɔfɔɛ aloo nɔ nɛ a pee lɛ Yuda bi a kusumi nɛ ji nyumu mi womi ɔ pɛ ji Yuda no. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Dabida! Yuda no kasakasa ji nɔ nɛ yeɔ Mawu gbi nɔ. Ejakaa Mawu hla we nihi nɛ a po a he lo kɛ wo mɛ nyumu mi, se mohu nihi nɛ a tsake a juɛmi kɛ a tsui mi nɛ e ngɛ hlae. Kikɛmɛ a nɔmlɔ nɛ tsake e tsui loo e wami si himi mi ɔ be adesa yi jemi nae, se mohu e yi jemi maa je Mawu ngɔ.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda no peemi he se nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Ke kikɛ ɔ ji Mawu blɔ nya tomi ɔ, lɛɛ mɛni ji Yuda no se nami mɔ? Anɛ Mawu to se nami titli ko ha mɛ lo? Anɛ nyumu mi womi ngɛ Yuda bi a kusumi nya a he ngɛ se nami ko lo? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ee, Yuda no he ngɛ se nami babauu. Kekle se nami ji, Mawu to e mlaa amɛ kɛ wo Yuda bi ɔmɛ a dɛ konɛ a le lɛ nɛ a pee e suɔmi nya ni. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />E ji anɔkuale kaa a ti ni komɛ he we lɛ yi, se anɛ enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa Mawu be e si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ yee, akɛnɛ mɛ hu a yi a si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ ha we lɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Dabi! E be mi bae ja. Ejakaa adesa fɛɛ adesa ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ, lakpatsɛ i, se Mawu lɛɛ anɔkualetsɛ ji lɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ David La a mi ke, Mawu Munyu ɔ maa pee anɔkuale daa, nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ma hla a, e maa na ja.<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Se ni komɛ de ke, “E hi kaa wa gbo Mawu tue, ejakaa wa yayami peemi ɔ hu he ngɛ se nami, ejakaa e ma ha nɛ nihi maa na bɔ nɛ Mawu hi ha, ke a na bɔ nɛ wa puɛ ha a. Anɛ e sa kaa e gblaa wa tue lo, ke wa he yayami ɔmɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa lɛ ɔ?” Kikɛ ɔ nɛ ni komɛ tuɔ munyu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />E be mi bae ja gblee! Nɛ mɛni Mawu ji lɛ ke e ma nga hɛ ngmɛ kɛ fɔ yayami nɔ? Nɛ kɛ e ma plɛ kɛ bu nɔ ko fɔ kɛɛ? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Ejakaa ke ye lakpa yemi ɔ woɔ anunyami kɛ baa haa lɛ, nɛ tsɔɔ kaa lɛɛ anɔkualetsɛ ji lɛ ɔ, kɛ e maa pee kɛɛ nɛ e maa kojo nɛ e maa bu mi fɔ kaa yayami peelɔ? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ke nyɛ nyɛɛ munyu nɛ ɔ se ɔ, nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma susu ji, ke wa puɛ wawɛɛ kɛ yayami ɔ, ja a ji bɔ nɛ Mawu suɔ. Se nihi nɛ ngɛ kikɛmɛ a juɛmi nɛ ɔ, a fɔ bumi kle. Se kɛ ɔ, ni komɛ deɔ ke ja a ji bɔ nɛ ye fiɛmi ɔ tsɔɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Ke ja a, anɛ wɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ pɛ wa hi pe ni kpa amɛ lo? Dabi, wa hí pi nɔ ko kulaa, ejakaa wa ye he odase momo kaa yayami peelɔ ji nɔ fɛɛ nɔ, Yuda no jio, ma je no jio, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ de ɔ, “Dalɔ ko be, nɔ kake po be je ɔ mi nɛ e yeɔ bemi.”<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Nɔ ko be nɛ nyɛɛ Mawu se bɔ nɛ sa, nɛ nɔ ko hu be nɛ ngɛ hlae kaa e maa nyɛɛ e se anɔkuale mi.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ gba ngɛ e blɔ ɔ nɔ, nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ pee yayami, nɛ nɔ ko kulaa be he ko nɛ e ngɛ kpakpa pee kɛ sa; nɔ ko be. <verse eid="ROM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />A kuɛ si bli voo kaa nɔ gbogboe muɔ mi, nɛ a yeɔ lakpa, nɛ a nya mi munyuhi ngɛ kaa sinɔ duɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Nɛ a nya mi munyu duɔ ngmangmaangma kɛ gbiɛmi.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />A he sɔɔ kɛ muɔ si puemi, nɛ a nyɛɛ nihi nɛ kɛ mɛ kpa we gbi ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Hɛ mi kpatami kɛ aywilɛho nihi nɛ a peeɔ ngɛ he fɛɛ he nɛ a maa gu; <verse eid="ROM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />nɛ a li nɔ́ nɛ ji yi baami blɔ loo Mawu gbaami.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />A yi Mawu gbeye nɛ a li kaa e susuu a he.<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu maa kojo Yuda bi ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ e be a ti nɔ kake po he ngmɛɛe, ejakaa a yi e mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ yayami mohu nɛ a peeɔ. Anɔkuale ji kaa je ɔ tsuo maa ye fɔ ngɛ Mawu Ope ɔ hɛ mi.<verse eid="ROM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Nyɛ na amlɔ nɛ ɔ kaa kɛ gu mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, a be nɔ ko bemi bue ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. Ejakaa ke wa le mlaa amɛ ɔ, e tsɔɔ wɔ kaa wa yi a nɔ, nɛ yayami peeli ji wɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a si mlaa amɛ a se, nɛ a je Mawu dami ɔ kpo, nɛ lɔ ɔ nɔ a maa da kɛ he wa yi wami, nɛ lɔ ɔ he odase nɛ mlaa a kɛ gbali ɔmɛ yeɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nihi tsuo nɛ heɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ yeɔ ɔ, a nine suu Mawu dami nɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />E ji anɔkuale kaa wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ pee yayami nɛ Mawu anunyami ɔ bɔ wɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Mawu na wɔ mɔbɔ nɛ e kɛ wa tɔmi ɔmɛ ke wɔ kɛ gu e Bi Yesu Kristo nɛ kpɔ wɔ kɛ je wa yayami ɔmɛ a mi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Ejakaa Mawu tsɔ Yesu Kristo kɛ ba nɛ e kɛ e muɔ ɔ ba he wa yayami ɔmɛ a he tue gblami ɔ, nɛ e kɛ po Mawu mi mi fumi nɛ e na wɔ ɔ se. Nɛ kɛ gu e muɔ ɔ kɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ e mi nɔ ɔ, wa ma na yi wami hemi. Be ko nɛ be ɔ, Mawu na wa he tsui nɛ e pui wa nya mi, ejakaa e ngɛ Kristo blɔ hyɛe nɛ e ba kpɔ wɔ kɛ je wa he yayami ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Mwɔnɛmwɔnɛ ɔ hu Mawu kɛ nihi a he yayamihi ngɛ mɛ kee ja a nɔuu, ejakaa Yesu je a he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ho. Se anɛ e sa kaa Mawu nɛ ngmɛɛ yayami peeli a he nɛ a ye a he, nɛ e de ke a yi fɔ lo? Dabi! Se e ngmɛɛ a he, ejakaa a he Yesu nɛ je a he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ho ɔ nɔ ye.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Lɛɛ mɛni ni tsumi nɔ nɛ wa maa fia kɛ fɔ kaa lɔ ɔ nɔ wa maa gu kɛ na wa yi wami hemi ɔ? Wa be fiami ko kulaa nɛ wa maa fia, ejakaa tsa pi ni tsumi kpakpa ko nɛ wa tsu ɔ he nɛ a bu wɔ bemi ngɛ, se mohu a he wa yi wami kɛ gu nɔ́ nɛ Kristo pee ha wɔ ɔ, kɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ wa ngɛ ngɛ e mi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Lɔ ɔ he ɔ, a bu wɔ bemi ngɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi nɛ wa ngɛ ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ he je, se tsa pi ngɛ ni tsumi kpakpa ko nɛ wa tsu ɔ he.<verse eid="ROM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Anɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ pɛ a yi wami nɛ Mawu heɔ kikɛ ɔ lo? Dabida! Ma je li ɔmɛ hu ma nyɛ ba Mawu ngɔ nɛ e ma he a yi wami ja a nɔuu. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Mawu hlɛ adesahi a mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e buu Yuda no kɛ ma je no nɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ kulaa bemi kake. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Jehanɛ ɔ nɛɛ, ke ji hemi kɛ yemi nɔ nɛ a guɔ kɛ heɔ wa yi wami ɔ, lɛɛ e sɛ kaa wa yeɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ lo? Tsa pi ja a kulaa i. Niinɛ, ja waa kɛ wa hɛ fɔ Yesu nɔ loko ji wa ma nyɛ ma he e nɔ maa ye tutuutu.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham okadi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ngɛ nɔmlɔ adesa blɔ fa mi ɔ, Abraham ji nɔ nɛ bɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ma a. Anɛ kɛ lɛɛ e susu ngɛ yi wami hemi kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ ɔ he kɛɛ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Anɛ e ni tsumi kpakpahi a he je nɛ Mawu bu lɛ bemi ngɛ lo? Ke e ni tsumi kpakpahi a he i jinɛ e ngɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ e maa fia kɛ fɔ nɔ. Se ngɛ Mawu blɔ fa mi ɔ, Abraham be fiami nɔ́ ko kulaa. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Ejakaa Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ ye odase ke Abraham he Mawu nɔ ye, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu kɛ e yayami ɔmɛ ke lɛ ngɛ nɛ e ngɔ lɛ ke “e yi fɔ” ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, tsa pi Abraham ni tsumi kpakpa amɛ a he je nɛ a ha lɛ sihi he ngɛ hiɔwe ngɛ ɔ lo? Dabida! Yi wami hemi ɔ, e ji níke nɔ, ejakaa ke tsa pi nɔ́ke nɔ i ɔ, nɔ ko nine be nɔ sue ngɛ ni tsumi kpakpa ko he. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />A kɛ kee nihi nɛ a tsu we e he ni. Ejakaa Mawu buɔ yayami peelɔ bemi, ke ji e heɔ Kristo nɔ yeɔ kaa e ma he e yi wami.<verse eid="ROM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Matsɛ David ye odase ngɛ bua jɔmi nɛ yayami peelɔ naa ke Mawu bu lɛ bemi ɔ he nɛ e de ke, <verse eid="ROM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“A gbaa nihi nɛ a ngɔ a tɔmi ɔmɛ kɛ ke mɛ, nɛ a tsi a yayami ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />A gbaa nɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ bui e yayami ɔmɛ a he akɔtaa hu.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Anɛ enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa a kɛ kikɛmɛ a gbaami nɛ ɔ haa nihi nɛ heɔ Kristo nɔ yeɔ, nɛ a yeɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ hu a nɔ, aloo a kɛ haa nihi nɛ a yi Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ se a heɔ Kristo nɔ yeɔ lo? Nɛ Abraham hu nɛɛ? Ejakaa wa deɔ ke e nine su gbaami nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ. Anɛ hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ aloo e ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ hu a nɔ loko ji a ha lɛ kikɛmɛ a gbaami nɛ ɔmɛ lo?<verse eid="ROM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Mɛni be mi nɛ Mawu gbaa Abraham? A gbaa lɛ loko ji e ba plɛ Yuda no nɛ a wo lɛ nyumu mi ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi nya.<verse eid="ROM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />A wui lɛ nyumu mi kɛ ya si be mi nɛ Mawu wo lɛ si kaa e maa gbaa lɛ ngɛ e hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he je, loko a wo lɛ nyumu mi. E nyumu mi womi ɔ ji okadi nɛ tsɔɔ kaa Abraham ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi momo nɛ Mawu ngɔ lɛ nɛ e pee lɛ dalɔ ngɛ e hɛ mi loko ji a wo lɛ nyumu mi ɔ nɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Abraham peeɔ mumi mi tsɛ kɛ ha nihi nɛ heɔ yeɔ nɛ a he a yi wami, nɛ pi Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ nɛ a yeɔ ɔ he je. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ wa na kaa Mawu peeɔ nihi nɛ a yi Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ se a ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ dali. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Nɛ Abraham nɔuu ji mumi mi tsɛ kɛ ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ a wo mɛ nyumu mi ɔ hulɔ, nɛ a maa na kɛ gu Abraham nɔ́ kaa tsa pi kikɛmɛ a kusumi nɛ ɔ nɛ heɔ a yi wami. Ejakaa Mawu na Abraham mɔbɔ kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ nɔ loko ji a wo lɛ nyumu mi. <verse eid="ROM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ wa na paa kaa Mawu wo Abraham si kaa e kɛ je ɔ tsuo ma ha lɛ kɛ e nina, pi ngɛ mlaa amɛ a nɔ nɛ e yeɔ ɔ he je, se mohu ngɛ Mawu nɔ nɛ e he ye kaa e maa ye e si womi ɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke nyɛ ngɛ dee ke Mawu gbaami ɔ e kɛ haa nihi nɛ yeɔ mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa Mawu si nɛ e wo nihi nɛ heɔ yeɔ ɔ, e ji yaka nɔ́ ko. Kɛkɛ lɛɛ hemi kɛ yemi he be se nami. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Anɔkuale ɔ kɛkɛ ji, Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi kɛ ha gbaami kɛ yi wami hemi nami ɔ, haa nɛ e naa wa he abofu, ejakaa wa tɔɔ mlaa amɛ a nɔ; se he nɛ mlaa ko be ɔ, tɔmi ko hu be lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu gbaami nɔ́ke nɔ ɔ hia hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ. Nɛ wa nine maa su nɔ ke wa ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ jio wa yi a nɔ jio. Waa hi hemi kɛ yemi kaa Abraham, nɔ nɛ ji wɔ tsuo wa tsɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi blɔ fa mi ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa Mawu pee Abraham mahi kulaa a tsɛ ɔ nɛ. Nɛ Mawu ma he nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ kaa Abraham ɔ yi wami ngɛ ma tsuaa ma mi. Kikɛmɛ a si womi ɔ je Tsɛ Mawu dɛ, nɔ nɛ tleɔ ni gbogboehi si, nɛ e tuɔ níhi nɛ maa ba amɛ a he munyu kɛ nɔ mi mami kaa níhi nɛ ngɛ momo ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Abraham be hɛ nɔ kami ko kulaa kaa e ma fɔ bi, se Mawu de lɛ ke e ma ha lɛ binyumuyo nɛ ma fɔ bimɛ fuu nɛ e maa bɔ ma agbo ɔ, e he Mawu ye. <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Akɛnɛ Abraham hemi kɛ yemi se ti ɔ, e hɛwi lɛ kaa e kɛ e yo Sara kulaa bwɔ, ejakaa e ye jeha lafa, nɛ e yo ɔ hu ye jeha nyingmi nɛɛ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a bi fɔmi be be.<verse eid="ROM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Abraham yi mi pee we lɛ sikɔsikɔ, se mohu e na hemi kɛ yemi agbo pe sa a, nɛ e je e yi kaa e gbaa lɛ loko ji Mawu si womi ɔ ba mi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Ejakaa e he ye kaa Mawu ma nyɛ ye e si womi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Abraham hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he je nɛ Mawu kɛ e he yayami ɔmɛ ke lɛ nɛ e pee lɛ dalɔ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Nɛ tsa pi Abraham nɔ kake he je nɛ a ngma ngɛ ke, “A ngɔ lɛ dalɔ ngɛ e hemi kɛ yemi nya” a. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Se wɔ hu wa piɛ he, nɛ e ngɛ nɔ mi mae kaa ke wa ye Mawu nɔ nɛ tle Yesu, wa Nutsɔ, si ke je gbeje ɔ si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, e ma he wɔ kulaa wa yi wami kaa bɔ nɛ e he Abraham yi wami ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Ejakaa e gbo ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he nɛ a tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ekohu ngɛ wa bemi bumi he.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Waa kɛ Mawu kpɛti he jɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, akɛnɛ a gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ kɛ bu wɔ bemi he je ɔ, he jɔmi ba waa kɛ Mawu kpɛti ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yesu Kristo, wa Nutsɔ ɔ, tsu kɛ ha wɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ejakaa ngɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi ɔ nya a, wa na he blɔ kɛ gu Yesu nɔ kɛ ba su e dloomi ɔ mi, nɛ wa ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Mawu to kɛ ha wɔ ɔ blɔ hyɛe kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="ROM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Tsa pi enɛ ɔ kɛkɛ, se wa yi gbeye nɛ wa bua jɔɔ wa he ngɛ amanehluhi kɛ kahi a mi tete, ejakaa kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ haa wa naa tsui si tomi.<verse eid="ROM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Nɛ tsui si tomi haa wɔ subai kpakpa nɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa wɔ kɛ ya suu benɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi kɛ he nɔ kami ɔ pii si.<verse eid="ROM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Kikɛmɛ a hɛ nɔ kami nɛ ɔ gbi wɔ zo, nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ mi ɔ, wa yi kɔmɔ. Wa le kaa Mawu suɔ wɔ saminya, nɛ wa nuɔ e suɔmi ɔ he ngɛ wa mi be fɛɛ be, ejakaa e ha wɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ, nɔ nɛ ma ha wa tsui mi ma hyi tɔ ke e suɔmi ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Kristo ba gbo kɛ kpɔ wɔ yayami peeli ngɛ be nɛ sa mi, ejakaa wa be hɛ nɔ kami ko jamɛ a be ɔ mi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Wa hɛ be nɔ kaa nɔ ko ma gbo ha wɔ yayami peeli, ejakaa e wa loko a gboɔ ngɛ dalɔ po nane mi. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Se Mawu je e suɔmi agbo nɛ e ngɛ ha wɔ ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ, ejakaa e ha nɛ Kristo ba gbo ngɛ wa nane mi be mi nɛ wa ji yayami peeli. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Si abɔ nɛ a bu wɔ yayami peeli bemi ngɛ e muɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ e ma he wa yi wami kɛ je Mawu abofu mi. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Benɛ wa ji e he nyɛli ɔ, e Bi ɔ ba kpata wa kpɛti kɛ gu e gbenɔ ɔ nɔ; nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ wa plɛ e huɛmɛ nɛ e ngɛ wa mi ɔ, mɛni gbaami nɛ wa be nae kɛ je e dɛ?<verse eid="ROM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Tsa pi enɛ ɔ kɛkɛ, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, wa bua jɔ si himi kpakpa nɛ ngɛ waa kɛ Mawu kpɛti kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo gbenɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ he.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Slɔɔto nɛ ngɛ Kristo kɛ Adam kpɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Benɛ Adam pee yayami ɔ, yayami ba je nɛ ɔ mi, nɛ gbenɔ gu yayami nɔ kɛ ba, nɛ gbenɔ ba to adesa we, ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ pee yayami. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Yayami ngɛ je ɔ mi loko ji a wo Mlaa a. Benɛ Mlaa a be ɔ, a bui yayami. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Gbenɔ ye matsɛ kɛ je Adam yi nɔ kɛ ya si Mose yi nɔ. Nɛ nihi tete nɛ pee we yayami nɛ ngɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Adam gbo Mawu tue ɔ, mɛ hu gbenɔ ye a nɔ. Nɛ Adam ji nɔ nɛ maa ba a he okadi. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Se slɔɔto agbo ngɛ adesa yayami peemi kɛ Mawu yayami pami kpɛti; ejakaa Adam nɔ kake pɛ e yayami nɛ e ha nɛ gbenɔ gu e yayami ɔ nɔ kɛ sa nihi babauu. Se Yesu Kristo lɛɛ e kɛ yayami pami ba ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɛ gu Mawu mɔbɔ nami nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kaa bɔ nɛ gbenɔ je Adam tɔmi ɔ mi kɛ ba ha nihi babauu ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ Kristo ba, nɛ e ba ngɔ a yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ho nɛ e ha mɛ wami. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ejakaa ke gbenɔ gu Adam nɔ kake yayami peemi nɔ kɛ ye matsɛ ɔ, lɛɛ nihi nɛ ma na Mawu dloomi nɔ́ke nɔ nɛ ji yayami pami kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ ɔ hu maa ye matsɛ ngɛ a wami kulaa mi.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />E ji anɔkuale kaa bɔ nɛ a bu adesa fɛɛ adesa fɔ ngɛ Adam tomi ɔ he ɔ, ja a kɛ̃ nɛ a gu Kristo dami ɔ nɔ kɛ kpata adesa kɛ Mawu kpɛti konɛ a na wami. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Adam ha nɛ nihi babauu pee yayami peeli, ejakaa e gbo Mawu tue nɛ Kristo ha nɛ nihi fuu plɛ dali ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, ejakaa e ye Mawu gbi nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />A ha wɔ Mlaa Nyɔngma amɛ konɛ waa na he nɛ wa gbo Mawu tue kɛ ya si. Se si abɔ nɛ wa naa wa yayami ɔmɛ ɔ, si abɔ nɛ wa yoɔ Mawu dloomi kɛ yayami pami ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Kekle ɔ, wa hi yayami nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ sisi nɛ wa na gbenɔ kɛ je mi, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Mawu mɔbɔ nami ɔ nɛ ngɛ matsɛ yee, nɛ e pee wɔ dali kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ kɛ yaa neneene wami mi.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yayami nɔ kunimi yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Se anɛ e sa kaa waa hi yayami pee kɛ sa konɛ Mawu nɛ hi wɔ mɔbɔ nae nɛ e kɛ hi wɔ kee daa kɛ daa lo?<verse eid="ROM 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2-3" />E sɛ kulaa, ejakaa kɛ je benɛ wa plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ a baptisi wɔ nɛ wa pee Kristo nihi kɛ gu e gbenɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, a kplɔ yayami he wami ɔ ngɛ wa he. <verse eid="ROM 6:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Kɛ gu wa baptisimi ɔ nɔ ɔ, a pu wa yayami peemi su ɔ kɛ Yesu benɛ e gbo ɔ, nɛ benɛ Tsɛ Mawu tle lɛ si ngɛ e anunyami he wami ɔ nya a, e ha wɔ hu e nyakpɛ wami he ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ejakaa waa kɛ lɛ pee kake, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, waa kɛ lɛ gbo benɛ e gbo ɔ, nɛ waa kɛ lɛ maa hi wami he ɔ mi, nɛ wa maa te si kaa bɔ nɛ lɛ hu e te si ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />A sɛu yayami nɔ́ ɔmɛ nɛ wa suɔ ɔ kɛ piɛ e he, nɛ a je wɔ kɛ je yayami nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ sisi, ejakaa a ku nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ wa mi nɛ haa wa peeɔ yayami ɔ dugudugu. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ke wa gbo ɔ, yayami be wa nɔ he wami hu. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Nɛ si abɔ nɛ wa yayami suɔmi su ɔ gbo kɛ Kristo ɔ, wa heɔ yeɔ kaa waa kɛ lɛ tsuo ma na wami he ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Kristo te si kɛ je gbeje nɛ e be gboe hu kɔkɔɔkɔ. Gbenɔ be e nɔ he wami ko hu. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />E gbo si kake kɛ ha wɔ tsuo nɛ e kɛ gbe yayami he wami. Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e kɛ Mawu ngɛ huɛ bɔmi mi kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, waa bu wa yayami peemi su ɔ kaa e gbo, nɛ e be hae nɛ wa maa pee yayami hu. Waa hi hɛ ngmle kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ, nɛ waa pee klaalo kɛ ha Mawu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko ha yayami he blɔ nɛ e ye matsɛ ngɛ nyɛ nɔ hu, se mohu nyɛ si yayami akɔnɔ ni ɔmɛ a se. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Nɛ nyɛ ko ngɔ nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ko kɛ hi yayami pee hu, se mohu nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ he kɛ ha Mawu kulaa kaa nihi nɛ a tle mɛ si kɛ je gbeje, nɛ nyɛɛ pee Mawu dɛ mi níhi nɛ e kɛ nyɛ ma tsu e ni tsumi kpakpahi. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, yayami be nyɛ nɔ matsɛ yee hu, ejakaa a pine nyɛ kɛ je mlaa a nɔ yemi sisi, he nɛ yayami na nyɛ he blɔ ngɛ nɛ e ngɔ nyɛ nyɔguɛ ɔ; nɛ piɔ ɔ, nyɛ ye nyɛ he ngɛ Mawu dloomi kɛ mɔbɔ nami nya.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Akɛnɛ a kpɔ wɔ kɛ je mlaa a sisi kɛ ba Mawu dloomi ɔ mi ɔ, anɛ lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa waa ya nɔ nɛ waa pee yayami nɛ e ko gba wa nya lo? Dabi!<verse eid="ROM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Anɛ nyɛ li kaa nyɛ ma nyɛ hla nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ Nutsɔ? Nyɛ ma nyɛ hla yayami, nɛ e kɛ gbenɔ baa a, aloo tue bumi, nɛ e kɛ bemi yemi baa a. Nɛ nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ he kɛ ha a, lɛ nɛ e maa pee nyɛ Nutsɔ, nɛ nyɛ maa pee e nyɔguɛhi. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Se nyɛɛ na Mawu si, ejakaa nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ he kɛ ha yayami nɛ e ye nyɛ nɔ matsɛ be ko nɛ be ɔ mi. Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ bu Mawu anɔkuale tsɔɔmi ɔ tue kɛ nyɛ tsui kulaa. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ ye nyɛ he, ejakaa a kpɔ nyɛ kɛ je yayami nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ sisi kɛ ba nyɛ Nutsɔ he nɛ ji Mawu dami ɔ mi.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />I kɛ nyɔguɛhi kɛ nutsɔhi tsɔɔ nyɛ níhi a nya, ejakaa e ma ha nɛ nyɛɛ na nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ hlae ma tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ nya. Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he nyɔguɛhi kɛ ha níhi nɛ da kɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu kaa bɔ nɛ kekle ɔ, nyɛ pee nyɛ he nyɔguɛhi kɛ ha yayami tsuaa yayami ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Benɛ yayami ye nyɛ nɔ matsɛ ɔ, nyɛ yi kpakpa peemi he kɔmɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Anɛ nyɛ wo yiblii kpakpa ko kɛ je yayami peemi mi lo? Dabi, nyɛ wui yiblii kpakpa ko, nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, ke nyɛ susu níhi nɛ nyɛ pee ɔmɛ a he ɔ, a ji zo kɛ ha nyɛ, ejakaa gbenɔ ji jamɛ a yayami ni ɔmɛ a he se nami. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ a kpɔ nyɛ kɛ je yayami nɔ yemi sisi, nɛ a pee nyɛ Mawu nyɔguɛhi ɔ, e he se nami ji klɔuklɔu peemi kɛ neneene wami nami. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ejakaa yayami he hiɔwo ɔ gbenɔ i. Se Mawu dloomi nɔ́ke nɔ ji neneene wami nɛ a naa kɛ guɔ Kristo Yesu wa Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mlaa be nyɛ nɔ he wami hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Anyɛmimɛ mlaa leli, suɔli ngɛ Kristo mi, anɛ nyɛ li kaa ke adesa gbo ɔ, mlaa ko be e nɔ he wami hu lo? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Wa naa kaa ke yo gba a, si abɔ nɛ e huno ɔ ngɛ je mi ɔ, mlaa fi lɛ kɛ pɛtɛ e huno ɔ he; se ke nyumu ɔ gbo ɔ, lɛɛ gbami mlaa a nui lɛ hu. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Nɛ e ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e gbaa nyumu kpa ke lɛ nitsɛ e suɔ. Se ke e huno ɔ gbo we nɛ e ya gba nyumu kpa a, lɛɛ e dɛ.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Anyɛmimɛ, ja a nɔuu nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ ji nyɛ hunohi kɛ nyɛ nutsɔhi, ngɛ be nɛ be ɔ mi. Se akɛnɛ nyɛɛ kɛ Yesu gbo ngɛ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ he je ɔ, a po nyɛɛ kɛ mlaa a kpɛti, nɛ e be nyɛ nɔ he wami ko hu. Nɛ nyɛ kpale kɛ ba wami mi ekohu benɛ a tle Kristo si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, nɛ nyɛ plɛ ni hehi. Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ plɛ nɔ nɛ a tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ e nihi, konɛ nyɛɛ wo yiblii kpakpahi kɛ ha Mawu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Benɛ yayami ngɛ nyɛ nɔ matsɛ yee ɔ, akɔnɔ níhi nɛ Mawu sume ɔ, a se nɛ nyɛ dii, nɛ a woɔ gbenɔ yiblii kɛ haa nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a kpɔ nyɛ kɛ je mlaa a dɛ mi, ejakaa nyɛ gbo benɛ nyɛ ngɛ mlaa a nɔ yemi sisi ɔ, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ nyɛ ma nyɛ sɔmɔ Mawu kɛ nyɛ tsui kɛ juɛmi kulaa kɛ mumi he amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ ngmɛɛ mlaa momo ɔmɛ a he ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Anɛ i ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa Mawu mlaa nɛ ɔmɛ a ji yayami lo? Dabi! Mlaa a pi yayami, se mohu e tsɔɔ mi yayami. Ejakaa jinɛ i be lee kaa akɔnɔ níhi nɛ ngɛ ye tsui mi ɔ, a ji yayami, ke mlaa de we mi ke, “O hɛ ko kɔ níhi a nɔ” ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Se yayami na he blɔ kɛ gu mlaa nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e tsɛɔ akɔnɔ níhi kɛ woɔ ye mi, ejakaa ke mlaa ko be nɛ a ma tɔ nɔ ɔ, yayami ko hu be si hie.<verse eid="ROM 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ i hi si saminya be mi nɛ i nui mlaa a sisi ɔ nɛ. Se benɛ i na anɔkuale ɔ, i nu sisi kaa i tɔ mlaa nɛ i pee yayami, nɛ i ngɛ kɛ ha gbenɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />I na kaa mlaa kpakpa a nɛ a to kaa e kpaka mi kɛ ya wami mi ɔ, e tsɛ gbenɔ mohu kɛ ha mi. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Yayami sisi mi, ejakaa e gu Mawu mlaa kpakpa amɛ a nɔ kɛ bu mi gbenɔ fɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Se jinɛ mlaa a hi nɛ mu ko be he.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Se kɛ e ba kɛɛ? Anɛ tsa pi mlaa nɛ ha ye hɛ mi kpata a lo? Kɛ e pee kɛ hí kɛɛ mɔ? Lɔ ɔ ji kaa yayami nɛ ji abosiami nɔ́ ɔ, nɛ gu nɔ́ kpakpa a nɔ kɛ kpata ye hɛ mi. Ejakaa e kɛ Mawu mlaa kpakpa amɛ tsu abosiami ni tsumi. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Mlaa ji nɔ́ kpakpa, se haomi ɔ je ami mohu ye ngɔ, ejakaa a jua mi nɛ i plɛ yayami nyɔguɛ.<verse eid="ROM 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Níhi nɛ haoɔ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Se i nui ye he lo sisi kulaa, ejakaa i suɔ nɛ ma pee nɔ́ nɛ da, se i nyɛ we, nɛ i peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ i sume mohu. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Akɛnɛ i peeɔ níhi nɛ sɛ kaa maa pee ɔ, ye he nile deɔ mi ke mlaa amɛ nɛ i gboɔ a nɔ tue ɔ, a hi. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Se tsa pi ye he wami nya ni nɛ i ngɛ tsue, ejakaa yayami nɛ ngɛ ye mi nɛ he wa pe mi ɔ nɛ ha nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ tsue.<verse eid="ROM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ngɛ ye yayami su ɔ he je ɔ, i le kaa nɔ́ kpakpa ko be ye mi. Nɛ bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ i bɔ mɔde kɛ ha a, i nyɛ we nɔ́ nɛ da ma pee. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ejakaa i pee we kpakpa nɛ i suɔ kaa ma pee ɔ, se mohu yayami nɛ i sume ɔ, lɔ ɔ mohu nɛ i peeɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke i peeɔ níhi nɛ i sume ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa tsa pi ami nitsɛ ye he wami nya ni nɛ i ngɛ pee ɔ; se mohu yayami nɛ wo mi kɔsɔkɔsɔ.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ ye mi ji, ke i ngɛ hlae nɛ ma tsu nɔ́ ko kpakpa a, kɛkɛ yayami mohu ba je mi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />I suɔ kaa ma pee Mawu suɔmi nya nɔ́ ngɛ ye su he ɔ nya mohu, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />se nɔ́ ko ngɛ ye mi nɛ e kɛ ye juɛmi ɔ ngɛ ta hwue, nɛ e ye kunimi nɛ e ha nɛ i pee nyɔguɛ kɛ ha yayami nɛ ngɛ ye mi kɛ sa a. Jinɛ ye juɛmi ji ma pee Mawu sɔmɔlɔ, se loloolo ɔ, yayami mohu ye mi nyɔguɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Oo! Ye ni ngɛ mɔbɔ! Mɛnɔ po ma kpɔ mi kɛ je kikɛmɛ a gbenɔ nyɔguɛ yemi nɛ ɔ mi? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Se i naa Mawu si kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ, ejakaa e ha nɛ i ye ye he.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ fɔ bumi ko be kɛ ha Yesu Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ hu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Ejakaa Mumi ɔ he wami nɛ ngɛ Kristo mi, nɛ haa nɔ neneene wami ɔ, kpɔ mi kɛ je yayami kɛ gbenɔ dɛ mi. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Tsa pi Mawu kita amɛ a nɔ yemi he je nɛ a he wa yi wami ngɛ, ejakaa wa nyɛ we a nɔ nɛ waa ye. Se mohu Mawu gu blɔ kpa nɔ kɛ kpɔ wɔ kɛ je yayami dɛ mi. Lɔ ɔ ji kaa e tsɔ lɛ nitsɛ e Bi kɛ ba ngɛ he lo su nɛ yayami be mi, nɛ e kɛ e he ba sã bɔ kɛ kpata yayami he wami nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ wa nɔ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Mawu tsu kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔ ha wɔ konɛ waa ye e mlaa amɛ a nɔ kɛ gu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ se nyɛɛmi mi, nɛ wa ko bu yayami su momo ɔ nɛ ngɛ wa mi ɔ tue hu.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Nihi nɛ a he lo ɔ yeɔ a nɔ matsɛ ɔ, a peeɔ he lo ɔ suɔmi nya ni, se nihi nɛ nyɛɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ se ɔ, a tsuɔ Mawu bua nɔ ni tsumi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ se nyɛɛmi kɛ wami kɛ he jɔmi baa. Se he lo ɔ se dimi woɔ nɔ kɛ yaa gbenɔ mi. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ejakaa yayami su momo ɔ nɛ ngɛ wa mi ɔ e kɛ Mawu yi. E bui Mawu mlaa amɛ tue, nɛ e be mɛ bue gblee. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ nihi nɛ dii he lo se ɔ, a be Mawu hɛ mi nyɛe maa sa a nɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔ yemi he ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ he lo ɔ yi nyɛ nɔ; nɛ ke Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ; lɛ nɛ e ngɛ nyɛ kpakae. Nɛ nyɛ kai kaa nɔ nɛ Kristo Mumi ɔ be e mi ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ ɔ pi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ kulaa. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />E ngɛ mi kaa Kristo ngɛ nyɛ mi mohu se nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ ma gbo ngɛ yayami he je; se nyɛ mumi ɔ lɛɛ e ngɛ neneene wami, ejakaa Kristo dla nyɛɛ kɛ Mawu kpɛti. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Nɛ ke Mawu Mumi nɛ tle Yesu si kɛ je gbeje ɔ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ, e ma ha nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ nɛ ma gbo ɔ yi ma na wami ekohu kɛ gu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ nɔuu nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anyɛmimɛ suɔli, wa yi wa yayami peemi su momo ɔ hiɔ, nɛ e be wa nɔ he wami nɛ e nyɛɛ wa nɔ nɛ wa peeɔ e suɔmi nya ni. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ke nyɛ di he lo ɔ se ɔ, nyɛ yi be wami nae; se ke nyɛ nyɛɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he wami se ɔ, e ma kpata he lo ɔ kɛ e yayami ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ nyɛ yi ma na wami. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ejakaa nihi nɛ Mawu Mumi ɔ kpakaa mɛ ɔ, mɛ ji Mawu bimɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sɛ nɛ waa ye gbeye kaa nyɔguɛhi, se mohu waa pee wa he kaa Mawu bimɛ nɛ a he kɛ wo e weku ɔ mi nɛ a hii lɛ tsɛe “Tsaatsɛ, Tsaatsɛ!” ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Ejakaa e Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ deɔ wɔ ngɛ wa tsui mi ke Mawu bimɛ ji wɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Akɛnɛ wa ji e bimɛ he je ɔ, wa nine maa su e weto ni ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ nihi nɛ e kɛ ha e Bi Yesu ɔ, piɔ nɛ ɔ, a peeɔ wɔ hu wa níhi. Se ke wa nine maa su e anunyami ɔ nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ e nɔ nami ɔ hu maa sa wa he.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Se anunyami nɛ e ma ha wɔ hwɔɔ se ɔ, e hiɛ hluu pe nɔ́ nami mi nɛ wa ngɛ piɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Nɛ adebɔ kulaa ngɛ e bi ɔmɛ a kpo jemi ɔ blɔ hyɛe kɛ tsui si tomi. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ngɛ jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, adebɔ níhi tsuo nɛ ngɛ yakayaka níhi a sisi nɛ pi mɛ nitsɛmɛ a suɔmi nya a, se ngɛ Mawu suɔmi nya a, a maa laa. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Nɛ adebɔ ni ɔmɛ nɛ bɔle wɔ kɛ kpe ɔ hu ma na anunyami he yemi kɛ je yayami mi kaa Mawu bi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ejakaa wa le kaa adebɔ níhi kulaa ngɛ piie nɛ a ngɛ nɔ́ nae kɛ ba si piɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Tsa pi mɛ kɛkɛ, se wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli tete, wɔ nihi nɛ wa na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ wa mi ɔ, wa kɛmɛɛ nɛ wa hii blɔ hyɛe nɛ a je wɔ kɛ je wa piimi kɛ nɔ́ nami ɔmɛ a mi. Nɛ wɔ hu wa ngɛ be nɛ Mawu to nɛ e ma kpɔ e bi ɔmɛ kɛ je nɔ́ nami kɛ amanehlu mi, nɛ e ma ha mɛ nɔmlɔ tso he nɛ be hiɔ nue, nɛ be gboe gbleegbleegblee ɔ blɔ hyɛe.<verse eid="ROM 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Hɛ kɛ nɔ fɔmi he je nɛ a he wa yi wami ngɛ. Hɛ kɛ nɔ fɔmi tsɔɔ kaa wa ngɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ wa nine sui nɔ lolo ɔ blɔ hyɛe, ejakaa ke nɔ ko nine su nɔ́ ko nɔ momo ɔ, e kɛ e hɛ fɔɛ e nami nɔ hu. <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Se ke wa ngɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ kɛ ha nɔ́ ko nɛ bɛ lolo ɔ, e sa kaa waa hyɛ blɔ kɛ tsui si tomi.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ja a nɔuu nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ yeɔ kɛ buaa wɔ ngɛ wa daa ligbi dengme gbomi kɛ sɔlemi mi. Ejakaa wa li bɔ nɛ sa kaa waa sɔle ha tete kɛ bi nɔ́ ko, se Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nitsɛ nɛ sɔleɔ kɛ daa mi haa wɔ kɛ kɔmɔ yemi nɛ a be nyɛe maa kale. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Nɛ Tsɛ ɔ nɛ le tsuihi tsuo a mi ɔ, le nɔ́ nɛ he pɛɛ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ kpae ha wɔ ngɛ Mawu nitsɛ suɔmi nya. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ke wa suɔ Mawu, nɛ wa ngɛ e blɔ nya tomi ɔ mi ɔ, wa maa le kaa níhi tsuo nɛ baa wa nɔ ɔ, a hi kɛ ha wɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ejakaa Mawu to e yi mi kɛ je sisije kaa nihi nɛ a kɛ a he ha lɛ ɔ, a hi kaa bɔ nɛ e Bi ɔ ngɛ ɔ, konɛ Bi ɔ nɛ pee Tɛte ngɛ nyɛmimɛ fuu a kpɛti. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Akɛnɛ e hla wɔ he je ɔ, e tsɛ wɔ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e bu wɔ “bemi”, nɛ e ha wa hyi tɔ kɛ Kristo dami ɔ, nɛ e wo wɔ si kaa wa nine maa su e anunyami ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu ngɛ wa se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Mɛni wa ma nyɛ de ngɛ nyakpɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he? Ke Mawu ngɛ wa se ɔ, mɛnɔ ma nyɛ te si kɛ wo wɔ? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Si abɔ nɛ e nyɛ ngɔ lɛ nitsɛ e Bi kɛ sã bɔ ha wɔ ɔ, anɛ e be wɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ hae lo?<verse eid="ROM 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Mɛnɔ ma nyɛ po wa nya, wɔ nihi nɛ Mawu hla kɛ ha lɛ nitsɛ e he ɔ? Mawu ji nɔ nɛ woɔ nɔ nguɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Mɛnɔ ji nɔ nɛ buu wɔ fɔ mɔ? Kristo lo? Dabi! Ejakaa lɛ ji nɔ nɛ gbo ngɛ wa he nɛ e te si ekohu kɛ ha wɔ, nɛ e hii si ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nine nɔ ngɛ hiɔwe ngɛ pɛɛ kpae ha wɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Mɛnɔ kulaa ma nyɛ kpɔ Kristo suɔmi ɔ ngɛ wa dɛ? Ke wa na haomi loo amanehlu, aloo ke a fia wɔ tu aloo a gbe wɔ ɔ, anɛ lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa e sume wɔ lo? Aloo ke hwɔ ngɛ wɔ yee aloo ohia ngɛ wɔ yee aloo oslaa ba na wɔ aloo gbenɔ miɔ nɛ e na wɔ ɔ, anɛ lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa Mawu je wa se lo?<verse eid="ROM 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Dabi, ejakaa Ngmami ɔ deɔ wɔ ke, ngɛ e he je ɔ, e sa nɛ waa pee klaalo kaa wa ma gbo be fɛɛ be, ejakaa wa ngɛ kaa tohi nɛ a wo mɛ kpa nɛ a maa gbe. <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Se ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ kulaa mi ɔ, wa yeɔ kunimi kɛ guu Kristo nɔ nɛ suɔ wɔ nɛ e gbo kɛ ha wɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ejakaa i heɔ yeɔ kaa gbenɔ loo wami loo bɔfohi loo abosiamihi a je he wami ɔmɛ tsuo, loo níhi nɛ wa ngɛ gbeye yee mwɔnɛ ɔ, loo haomihi nɛ maa ba wa nɔ hwɔɔ, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />loo hiɔwe loo wo sisi lokoo nɔ́ ko nɔ ko be nyɛe ma gba waa kɛ Mawu suɔmi nɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo je kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ benɛ e gbo kɛ ha wɔ ɔ kpɛti.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Israel gbosi ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Oo, ye nyɛmimɛ, Israel bi! I na nɛ nyɛ ba Kristo ngɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2-3" />I ngɛ nyɛ he kɔmɔ yee nyɔ kɛ pia, nɛ ye tsui ngɛ mi yee. Kristo kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ le kaa tsa pi lakpa nɛ i ngɛ yee, ke i de ke i ma suɔ nɛ a bu mi fɔ ngɛ nyɛ nane mi, ke ye fɔ bumi ɔ ma he nyɛ yi wami. <verse eid="ROM 9:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Mawu ke nyɛ níhi babauu se loloolo ɔ, nyɛ bui lɛ tue. E ngɔ nyɛ kaa lɛ nitsɛ e bimɛ pɔtɛɛ komɛ. Nyɛ ji nihi nɛ e hla, nɛ e kpaka nyɛ dɔdɔɔdɔ kɛ hɛ mi nyami nɛ e de nyɛ bɔ nɛ e suɔ nɛ e gbaa nyɛ ha. Ja a nɔuu nɛ e ha nyɛ mlaahi kɛ ha nyɛ wami si himi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ le nɔ́ nɛ e ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ pee. E ha nyɛ he blɔ nɛ nyɛ ja lɛ, nɛ e ha nyɛ si womi titli komɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Mawu nimli nguahi ji nyɛ tsɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ Kristo nitsɛ hu peeɔ nyɛ ti nɔ kake, nɛ e ji Yuda no nɛ a fɔ lɛ ngɛ he lo blɔ fa mi; nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɔ matsɛ yee amlɔ nɛ ɔ. A je Mawu yi kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Anɛ Mawu yi si womi ɔmɛ nɛ e wo Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nɔ lo? Dabi! E si womi ɔmɛ ngɛ kɛ ha nihi nɛ ji Yuda bi tutuutu. Nɛ tsa pi nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a fɔ ngɛ Yuda weku ɔ mi ji Yuda no kasakasa. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ejakaa Ngmami ɔmɛ de ke Abraham ngɛ bi kpahi mohu, se si womi ɔmɛ ngɛ kɛ ha Abraham bi Isak kɛ e nina kɛkɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, tsa pi nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ Abraham fɔ ɔ ji e bi kasakasa. <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa tsa pi Abraham bi ɔmɛ tsuo ji Mawu bimɛ.<verse eid="ROM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ejakaa Mawu wo si ke, “Ma ha mo kɛ Sara binyumu jeha nɛ maa ba a mi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Nɛ pi lɔ ɔ kɛkɛ, se benɛ Rebeka kɛ wa nɛnɛkasowa Isak na muklii, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />nɛ e fɔ we e hawi ɔmɛ lolo, nɛ a maa pee nɔ́ kpakpa ko loo yayami, se bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Mawu yi mi tomi kɛ ha nɔ hlami ɔ nɛ tsa nɔ, pi ngɛ ni tsumi nya, se e tsɛmi nya a, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Mawu de Rebeka ke, “Nɔkɔtɔma a ma sɔmɔ jokuɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Kaa bɔ nɛ a ngma ke, “I suɔ Yakob, se i sume Esau” ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Anɛ Mawu pee nɔ́ ko nɛ dɛ lo? Dabi! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Ejakaa Mawu de Mose ke, “I naa nɔ nɛ i suɔ ɔ mɔbɔ, nɛ i yeɔ kɛ buaa nɔ nɛ he nɔ́ dɔɔ mi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu jɔɔmi baa nɔ ko nɔ tsa pi ngɛ e suɔmi nya aloo e ni tsumi he je. Se mohu ɔ, Mawu kɛ haa nihi nɛ e suɔ mɛ nɛ e naa mɛ mɔbɔ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Nɛ Farao nɛ ji Mizraim matsɛ ɔ ji okadi ngɛ sane nɛ ɔ he. Ejakaa Mawu de lɛ ke e ngɔ Mizraim matsɛ yemi ɔ ngɔ ha lɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e je e he wami ɔ kpo kɛ gu e nɔ konɛ a tsi e anunyami biɛ ta ngɛ je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu naa nihi nɛ e suɔ ɔ mɔbɔ, nɛ e haa nɛ ni komɛ hu bui lɛ tue. <verse eid="ROM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ke kikɛ ɔ ji blɔ nya tomi ɔ, lɛɛ mɛni he je nɛ Mawu piaa nihi nɛ bui lɛ tue ɔ mɔ? Anɛ a pee we e suɔmi nya ni lo?<verse eid="ROM 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Dabi! O be he blɔ nɛ o deɔ ja. Mɛnɔ ji mo nɛ o tuɔ munyu kɛ siɔ Mawu? Anɛ e sa nɛ nɔ nɛ a bɔ ɔ nɛ e de nɔ nɛ bɔ lɛ ɔ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ o bɔ mi kikɛ ɔ ngɛ?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Anɛ buɛ puɛlɔ be he blɔ nɛ e kɛ zu kake nɛ e pɔtɔ ɔ eko puɛɛ bue nɛ ngɛ fɛu nɛ a kɛ mɔmɔ woɔ mi, nɛ e kɛ jamɛ a zu ɔ nɔuu eko puɛɛ buɛ nɛ a kɛ duɔmi woɔ mi lo? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Anɛ Mawu be he blɔ nɛ e jeɔ e abofu kɛ e he wami kpo kɛ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ sa hɛ mi kpatami, se e to e tsui si kɛ ha mɛ kɛ ba si piɔ lo? <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23-24" />Ja a nɔuu kɛ nɛ e ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e naa wɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ e to nɛ a ngɔ e anunyami ɔ kɛ wo wa mi ɔ mɔbɔ, Yuda no jio, Hela no jio, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e na e anunyami ɔ agbo jemi ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 9:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Nyɛ kai nɔ nɛ Mawu de kɛ gu Gbalɔ Hosea nɔ ke e ma hla bi kpahi nɛ pi Yuda weku ɔ mi nɛ a je, nɛ nɔ ko sume mɛ hyɛ, nɛ e maa suɔ mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Nɛ wɔ jali nɛ a de ngɛ a he be ko nɛ be ɔ mi ke, “Tsa pi ye bimɛ ji nyɛ” ɔ, a ma tsɛ mɛ “Mawu Hɛ kalɔ ɔ bimɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Gbalɔ Yesaia kpa ngmlaa nɛ e de ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a he ke, ke a yi bɔ hiɛ kaa wo nya zia tete, a ti nihi bɔɔ kɛkɛ a yi wami nɛ a ma he.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />“Ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ kojomi ɔ se be kɛe ngɛ zugba a nɔ, ejakaa e maa po e sane yemi ɔmɛ a nɔ kpiti ngɛ dami mi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Nɛ Yesaia de ngɛ he kpa ko hu ke, ke pi Mawu mɔbɔ nami he je i ɔ, jinɛ e ma kpata Yuda bi ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ e ba mi ngɛ Sodom ke Gomora ma amɛ a mi ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Lɛɛ kɛ wa ma de ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a he kɛɛ? Lɔ ɔ kɛkɛ ji, ma je li ɔmɛ hla we Mawu se blɔ mohu, se e ha mɛ he blɔ nɛ a di hemi kɛ yemi ɔ se. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Se Yuda bi ɔmɛ mohu nɛ dii Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi se veveeve, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a sa Mawu hɛ mi ɔ, a nyɛ we. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Mɛni he je? Ejakaa a gui hemi kɛ yemi nɔ kɛ hla we yi wami hemi se blɔ, se mohu a ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ mlaa amɛ a nɔ. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a tɛ tɛ ngua a, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu bɔ mɛ kɔkɔ ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi ke, “I kɛ tɛ ngua ko ma si ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a blɔ mi, nɛ a ti nihi babauu ma tɛ; se a ti nihi nɛ ma he e nɔ maa ye ɔ, zo be mɛ gbee.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="s1">Hemi kɛ yemi kɛ he yayami jajemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, nɔ nɛ ye tsui ngɛ hlae nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee ngɛ he ji kaa a he Yuda bi ɔmɛ a yi wami. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />I le kaa a hɛ dɔɔ ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi nyami he mohu, se a gui blɔ nɛ sa a nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Ejakaa a li kaa a kɛ Mawu kpɛti dlami he je nɛ Kristo ba gbo ngɛ. Se mohu a dii mɛ nitsɛmɛ a dami se, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a sa Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ a yeɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ kɛ kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ nɛ, se tsa pi Mawu yi wami hemi blɔ ɔ ji lɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />A nui sisi kaa Kristo haa nihi nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ níhi kulaa nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a nine nɛ su nɔ ngɛ mlaa a nɔ yemi mi ɔ. Lɛ ji nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nyagbe.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Ejakaa Mose ngma ke loko a ma wo nɔ ko e he yayami ngɔ ke lɛ nɛ a ma he e yi wami ɔ, ja e da kɛ pi si nɛ e ye ka fɛɛ ka nɔ kunimi, nɛ e pee we yayami ko kulaa ngɛ e wami mi. <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Se yi wami hemi nɛ a naa ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi mi ɔ de ke, “E he hia we kaa o ya hla Kristo ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ e kple si nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua mo,” nɛ <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />“E he hia we kaa o ya gbeje nɛ o ya ngɔ Kristo kɛ ba wami mi ekohu.”<verse eid="ROM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ejakaa yi wami hemi nɛ a naa ngɛ Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi mi ɔ, nɛ e he munyu ji nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ fiɛe ha nyɛ ɔ, e ngɛ wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ kasa nya haa; lɔ ɔ ji kaa e su wa he haa kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa tsuihi kɛ wa nyahi ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ejakaa ke o kɛ o nya de ni kpahi ke Yesu Kristo ji o Nutsɔ, nɛ o he ye ngɛ o tsui mi kaa Mawu tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, a ma he o yi wami. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ejakaa adesa tsui nɛ e kɛ heɔ yeɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ dlaa e kɛ Mawu a kpɛti; nɛ e nya nɛ e kɛ jajeɔ e hemi kɛ yemi ɔ maa e yi wami hemi ɔ nɔ mi. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ejakaa Ngmami ɔmɛ deɔ wɔ ke nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ Kristo nɔ yeɔ ɔ, zo be lɛ gbee. <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ngɛ enɛ ɔ blɔ fa mi ɔ, slɔɔto ko be Yuda no kɛ ma je no a kpɛti; ejakaa mɛ tsuo kulaa Nutsɔ kake nɛ a ngɛ, nɛ lɛ nɔuu hu ji niatsɛ kɛ ha nihi tsuo nɛ biɔ lɛ nɔ́ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ tsɛɔ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ ɔ, a ma he e yi wami.<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Se kɛ a maa pee kɛ bi lɛ nɛ e he a yi wami kɛɛ, ke a he we e nɔ yi? Nɛ kɛ a maa pee kɛ he e nɔ ye kɛɛ, ke a nui e he munyu ko? Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu, kɛ a maa pee kɛɛ nɛ a maa nu e he munyu ko ke fiɛlɔ ko fiɛ we ha mɛ? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Aloo kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ nɔ ko maa fiɛ kɛ ha mɛ ke nɔ ko tsɔ we lɛ? Nɛ lɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ ngɛ dee ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ nihi nɛ fiɛɔ Mawu he jɔmi Manye Munyu ɔ, nɛ a kɛ nɔ́ kpakpahi a he bua jɔmi sanehi ba haa wɔ ɔ, a nanehi ngɛ fɛu ha” a nɛ. E sisi ji, nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ a nyaa nihi nɛ fiɛɔ Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ a he ha.<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Se mohu tsa pi nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ bu Manye Munyu ɔ tue ɔ nɛ nya he, ejakaa Gbalɔ Yesaia de ke, “Nutsɔ, mɛnɔ he mi ye benɛ i de mɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Se kɛ ɔ, he nɛ a naa hemi kɛ yemi ɔ kɛ jee ji Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ ji Kristo he Manye Munyu ɔ tue bumi mi.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Se Yuda bi ɔmɛ lɛɛ nɛɛ, anɛ a nu Mawu Munyu ɔ lo? Ee, a nu, ejakaa Manye Munyu ɔ pɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he nɛ a ngɛ ɔ, nɛ a fiɛ kɛ ya su je ɔ mi nyagbe hehi kulaa. <verse eid="ROM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Anɛ a nu Munyu ɔ sisi lo, kaa Mawu maa ngɔ e yi wami hemi ɔ kɛ ha ni kpahi ke a kua ke a be ngɔe ɔ? Ee, ejakaa Mawu de ngɛ Mose be ɔ mi tɔɔ ke, e ma ha nɛ e bi ɔmɛ maa je hunga, ejakaa e maa ngɔ e yi wami hemi ɔ kɛ ha kuasia wɔ jali a ma amɛ konɛ e kɛ ha nɛ a hɛ nɛ tsiɛ. <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Pee se ɔ, Yesaia hu de kɛ kã ke nihi nɛ hla we Mawu se blɔ ɔ, mɛ mohu nɛ a maa na lɛ. <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Se loloolo ɔ, e ngɛ nine fɔe kɛ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ tsɛe, se akɛnɛ a ji kuɛ mi tili he je ɔ, a kua e ngɔ bami.<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu kua we e nimli ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i ngɛ bie ke, anɛ Mawu kua e bimɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ lo? Dabi! Nyɛ kai kaa ami nitsɛ hu Yuda no nɛ je Abraham mi ji mi, nɛ a fɔ mi kɛ wo Benyamin weku ɔ mi.<verse eid="ROM 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2-3" />Dabi, Mawu kua we lɛ nitsɛ e nimli nɛ e hla kɛ je sisije ɔ. Anɛ nyɛ kai nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de benɛ Gbalɔ Elia po Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nya kɛ ha Mawu ke a gbe gbali ɔmɛ, nɛ a ku e bɔ sami la tɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ lɛ nɔ kake too pɛ ji nɔ nɛ piɛ nɛ suɔ Mawu, nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a gbe lɛ hu ɔ lo?<verse eid="ROM 11:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Nɛ nyɛ kai heto nɛ Mawu ha lɛ ɔ lo? Mawu de lɛ ke, “Dabi, tsa pi mo nɔ kake too nɛ piɛ. I ngɛ nimli akpe kpaago ngɛ o se nɛ suɔ mi kɛ sa nɛ a kpla we si kɛ ha we wɔ ko.”<verse eid="ROM 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ja a nɔuu nɛ e ngɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ. Tsa pi Yuda bi ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ kpale ngɛ Mawu se, se mohu nihi bɔɔ ngɛ, nɛ e hla ngɛ e mɔbɔ nami kɛ e dloomi ɔ nya, nɛ a ma he a yi wami. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke Mawu dloomi he je i ɔ, lɛɛ tsa pi a himi nɛ a hi ɔ he je i, ejakaa ke a himi he je i ɔ, lɛɛ dloomi ɔ pi dloomi hu.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, bɔ nɛ e ngɛ ha ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. Yuda bi ɔmɛ ɔ, a ti nihi babauu a nine sui Mawu mɔbɔ nami ɔ nɛ a ngɛ hlae ɔ nɔ; a ti nihi bɔɔ nɛ Mawu hla a pɛ nɛ a nine su nɔ, se ni nɛmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ lɛɛ a yu a hɛ ngmɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ngmami ɔ tu nɔ́ nɛ ɔ he munyu ke, Mawu fɔ a nɔ mahe, nɛ e ha nɛ a hɛ ngmɛhi yu nɛ a tuehi tsi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko nu Kristo he munyu ɔ nɛ wa ngɛ fiɛɛ ɔ sisi. Nɛ ja a ji bɔ nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Matsɛ David hu de ke, “Ha nɛ a nya mi ngma kpakpa kɛ a dloomi ni kpa amɛ nɛ mlɔɔ a hɛ mi nɛ a susu kaa a kɛ Mawu kpɛti ngɛ kpakpa. Ha nɛ nɔ́ kpakpa amɛ a pee tue gblami níhi kɛ ha mɛ nitsɛmɛ nɛ a kpata a hɛ mi. <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Ha nɛ a hɛ mi nɛ wo diblii nɛ a ko hyɛ nɔ́; nɛ a mi nɛ dɔ kɛ tlomi nɛ jiɔ kɛ ya neneene.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Anɛ enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa Mawu ngmɛɛ lɛ nitsɛ e nimli nɛ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a he kulaa lo? Dabi! Mawu blɔ nya tomi ɔ ji, e maa ngɔ yi wami hemi ɔ kɛ ha ma je li ɔmɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a hɛ nɛ dɔ nɛ a je hunga konɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a di Mawu yi wami hemi ɔ se. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ ke je ɔ tsuo na ni ngɛ Mawu yi wami hemi nɛ e kɛ ha mɛ ɔ he je, be mi nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ lɛɛ a kua yi wami hemi ɔ he pɛtɛmi ɔ, lɛɛ je ɔ ma na jɔɔmi babauu pe enɛ ɔ ke Yuda bi ɔmɛ hu ba Yesu ngɔ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ le ɔ, Mawu tsɔ mi nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ nyɛ ngɔ kaa tsɔlɔ titli ko. I maa munyu nɛ ɔ nɔ mi nɛ i kaiɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ngɛ he be fɛɛ be, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />kaa alinɔ ma nyɛ ha nɛ a di nɔ́ nɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a nine su nɔ ɔ se lo, konɛ a gu nɔ kɛ he a ti ni komɛ a yi wami. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Nɛ e maa pee gbeye nɔ́ ke Yuda bi ɔmɛ plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli, ejakaa benɛ Mawu kua mɛ ɔ, e ngɔ hɛ kɛ fɔ ni kpahi ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ nɔ nɛ e ma he a yi wami. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e maa pee nyakpɛ sane agbo ke Yuda bi ɔmɛ maa kpale kɛ ba Kristo ngɔ. E ngɛ kaa ni gbogboehi nɛ te si kɛ je gbeje. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Si abɔ nɛ Mawu nimli ji Abraham kɛ gbali ɔmɛ ɔ, a bimɛ hu peeɔ Mawu bimɛ. Ejakaa ke tso ɔ sipoku ɔ ngɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ, e kɔni ɔmɛ hu maa pee klɔuklɔu.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Se a po tso kɔnihi nɛ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ nɛ je Abraham mi ɔ kɛ fɔ he nɛ a ngɔ ma je li nɛ je nga mi nu tso nɔ́ ɔ ngɔ ta he. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ nyɛ hu nyɛ nine su Mawu gbaami nɛ e wo Abraham kɛ e bi ɔmɛ he si ɔ nɔ, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e nu tso ɔ mi niye ni ɔ eko nae.<verse eid="ROM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Se nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ hi nɛ nyɛ ko fia kaa a ngɔ nyɛ ngɔ to kɔni ɔmɛ nɛ a po ɔmɛ a nane mi. Nɛ nyɛ kai kaa Mawu tso ɔ he kɔnihi nɛ nyɛ ji amlɔ nɛ ɔ he je nɛ nyɛ he ba se nami ngɛ; nɛ tsa pi tso ɔ sipokuhi ji nyɛ se e kɔnihi kɛkɛ.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Eko ɔ, nyɛ ma de ke, “Saminya, a po tso kɔni ɔmɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a je blɔ ha mi, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa nɛ ma hi bɔ nɛ sa.”<verse eid="ROM 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Nyɛ kai kaa a po tso kɔni ɔmɛ nɛ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ, ejakaa a he we Mawu nɔ yi, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi he je nɛ a ngɔ nyɛ kɛ to lejɛ ɔ ngɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko fia, se mohu nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si nɛ nyɛɛ na lɛ si nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ hi. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ejakaa ke Mawu na we kɔnihi nɛ ngɛ tso ɔ he kekle ɔ mɔbɔ ɔ, e be nyɛ hu mɔbɔ nae.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yeɔ e si womihi a nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Nyɛɛ le bɔ nɛ Mawu mi mi jɔ nɛ e sane hu wa kɛ ha. E sane wa ngɛ nihi nɛ gboɔ lɛ tue ɔ a nɔ, se e peeɔ nihi nɛ suɔ lɛ nɛ a heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ kpakpa. Nɛ ke nyɛ hu nyɛ he we lɛ yi ɔ, a maa po nyɛ hu ngɔ sake kɛ fɔ he. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Se ke Yuda bi ɔmɛ ngmɛɛ hemi nɛ a he we e nɔ́ yi ɔ he nɛ a kpale kɛ ba e ngɔ ekohu ɔ, e maa ngɔ mɛ kɛ ta tso ɔ he ekohu, ejakaa e ngɛ he wami nɛ e kɛ ma nyɛ pee ja.<verse eid="ROM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ejakaa ke Mawu po nyɛ ngɛ nga mi nu tso he ngɔ ta lɛ nitsɛ e tso kpakpa a he, nɔ́ ko nɛ a pɔɛ peemi ɔ, anɛ nyɛ he we yi kaa e maa ngɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ekohu ngɔ ta mɛ nitsɛmɛ a tso ɔ he lo?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Mamimɛ, ma suɔ nɛ nyɛɛ le kikɛmɛ a anɔkuale sane nɛ je Mawu ngɔ nɛ ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si nɛ nyɛ ko fia. Ee, e ji anɔkuale sane kaa amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ te si kɛ si Manye Munyu ɔ, se enɛ ɔ se be kɛe, ke ma je li ɔmɛ tsuo ba Kristo ngɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Kɛkɛ ɔ a ma he Israel tsuo yi wami. Nyɛ kai nɔ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ de ngɛ enɛ ɔ he ɔ ke, “Kpɔlɔ ko maa te si ngɛ Zion, nɛ lɛ e ma ba je Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ je a yayami ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="ROM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ ma ngɔ a he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ho kaa bɔ nɛ i wo si ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ti nihi fuu ji Manye Munyu ɔ he nyɛli, ejakaa a sume Munyu ɔ. Se nyɛ na enɛ ɔ he se, ejakaa e ha nɛ Mawu ngɔ e nike ni ɔmɛ ngɔ ha nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ. Se kɛ ɔ, Mawu suɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ngɛ si nɛ e wo Abraham kɛ Isak kɛ Yakob ɔ he. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Nɛ Mawu be e nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ e tsɛmi ɔ se gblae, ejakaa e be si womi ɔ nɔ tɔe. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Be nɛ be ɔ, nyɛ bui Mawu tue, se benɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ kua e nike ni ɔmɛ ɔ, e na nyɛ mohu mɔbɔ ngɛ tue nɛ a bui lɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ ji tue gboli, se be ko maa ba nɛ a maa na mɛ hu mɔbɔ kaa bɔ nɛ a na nyɛ mɔbɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Ejakaa Mawu ngmɛɛ mɛ tsuo a he kɛ ha tue gbomi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e na mɛ tsuo mɔbɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Oo, wa Mawu ɔ he ngɛ nyakpɛ! E nile kle nɛ e ji niatsɛ agbo; wa nɛ e kojomi ɔmɛ a sisi, nɛ wa nɛ e blɔ ɔmɛ hu a nya. <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Ejakaa wa ti mɛnɔ nɛ le Nutsɔ ɔ juɛmi. Nɛ mɛnɔ le ni, bɔ nɛ e maa pee lɛ e ga wolɔ kɛ e kpakalɔ? <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Nɛ mɛnɔ ma nyɛ ha lɛ nyɔ mi ni bɔ nɛ sa nɛ e ma ha nɛ e pee nɔ́ ko? <verse eid="ROM 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ejakaa Mawu dɛ mi pɛ nɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ jee, nɛ e he wami nya nɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ngɛ, nɛ a ngɛ kɛ ha e hɛ mi nyami womi. A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha lɛ kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu nike ni ɔmɛ a he ni tsumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, mamimɛ, i ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae nɛ nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ kɛ ha Mawu. Nyɛ ha nɛ a pee bɔ sami níhi nɛ hɛ mi ka nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu, níhi nɛ maa sa Mawu hɛ mi. Ke nyɛ susu nɔ́ nɛ e pee kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ he ɔ, anɛ nɔ́ ko agbo ji enɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɛ nyɛ bie lo? <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Nyɛ ko ba nyɛ je mi kaa je mi bi ɔmɛ, nɛ nyɛ ko di je ɔ mi níhi a se, se mohu nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he nimli hehi ngɛ nyɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ peemi mi, kɛkɛ ɔ, nyɛ ma yɔse bɔ nɛ e blɔ ɔmɛ maa hi kɛ ha nyɛ ha.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Akɛnɛ Mawu tsɔlɔ ji mi he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ dee ke e ye lɛ nitsɛ e he odase ngɛ anɔkuale mi, nɛ e bu hemi kɛ yemi nɛ Mawu kɛ ha lɛ ɔ he akɔtaa nɛ e hyɛ ha. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4-5" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ nɔmlɔ tso kake he níhi hiɛ fuu ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ Kristo nɔmlɔ tso ɔ hu ngɛ. E nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he níhi ji wɔ tsuo, nɛ wɔ tsuo wa piɛ he loko e peeɔ mluku, ejakaa wɔ tsuo wa ni tsumi ngɛ slɔɔto. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ngɛ kɛ ha wa bi, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ e he nɔ́ hia e nyɛmi.<verse eid="ROM 12:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Mawu dloo wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nile slɔɔto ko nɛ e kɛ peeɔ nɔ́ pɔtɛɛ ko saminya. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke o dloomi ɔ ji gbami ɔ, moo gba be fɛɛ be, si abɔ nɛ o hemi kɛ yemi ɔ pi si nɛ Mawu sɛ baa o ngɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Nɛ ke o dloomi ɔ ji kaa o sɔmɔ ni kpahi ɔ, mo sɔmɔ mɛ saminya, nɛ ke tsɔɔlɔ ji mo ɔ, moo tsɔɔ ni ɔ bɔ nɛ sa. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ fiɛɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ, e fiɛ Munyu ɔ saminya bɔ nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua. Nɔ nɛ Mawu dloo lɛ sika a, e dɛ mi nɛ jɔ nɛ e ye kɛ bua ohiafohi. Nɔ nɛ a ha lɛ ni tsumi he blɔ nya tomi he nile nɛ e ngɛ ni tsumi ko nɔ hyɛe ɔ, e tsu ni ɔ kɛ hɛ dɔ. Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ woɔ nihi a bua a, a pee kɛ tsui mi jɔmi kaa Kristo se nyɛɛli.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Osato peemi nɛ ko hi suɔmi mi, se mohu nyɛ suɔmi ɔ nɛ hi kɛ pi si. Nyɛɛ nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ dɛ, nɛ nyɛ fi nɔ́ kpakpa se. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he kɛ nyɛmimɛ a suɔmi nɛ nyɛɛ bu nyɛ he. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Nyɛ ko pee hejɔ ngɛ ni tsumi mi, se nyɛ sɔmɔ Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ nyɛ tsui kulaa.<verse eid="ROM 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Nyɛ na níhi tsuo nɛ Mawu to kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ he bua jɔmi. Nyɛɛ to nyɛ tsui si ngɛ haomi mi, nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle daa. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Nyɛ ji nihi nɛ sa kaa nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua Mawu bimɛ nɛ e fi mɛ ɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ pee nihi nubwɔ.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Ke nɔ ko wa nyɛ yi mi ngɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ nyɛ ji ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko gbiɛ lɛ se mohu nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ Mawu nɛ gbaa lɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Nyɛɛ kɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ nyae ɔ nɛ nya, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ kɔmɔ yee ɔ nɛ ye kɔmɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Nyɛɛ pee kake kɛ tsu ni. Nyɛ ko pee nyɛ he ni agbo peeli, se mohu nyɛɛ kɛ nihi nɛ baa a he si ɔ nɛ bɔ; nɛ nyɛ ko bu nyɛ he ni leli.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Nyɛ ko ngɔ yayami kɛ to yayami nane mi; nɛ nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi bɔ nɛ nihi maa na kaa anɔkualetsɛmɛ ji nyɛ nɛ nyɛ hi kɛ pi si. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Nyɛɛ kɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko pɛ; nɛ nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hi si ngɛ tue mi jɔmi mi.<verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Mamimɛ suɔli, nyɛ ko to nɔ ko yayami nane mi. Nyɛɛ ngmɛɛ enɛ ɔ he kɛ ha Mawu nɛ e ye kɛ ha nyɛ, ejakaa e wo si kaa e maa to nane mi kɛ ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ e sa mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ke hwɔ ngɛ o he nyɛlɔ yee ɔ, ha lɛ ni nɛ e ye. Ke kuma nɛ ngɛ lɛ yee ɔ, ha lɛ nyu nɛ e nu, ejakaa ke o pee ja a, o ngɛ “ ha kɛ la muɔe kɛ ngɛ e yi kpɛti puee.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa zo maa gbe lɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ e pee ɔ he. Ko ha yayami he blɔ nɛ e ye o nɔ, se mohu o pee kpakpa kɛ ye yayami nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ je mi bami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ba e he si kɛ ha ma nɔ yeli, ejakaa Mawu ji nɔ nɛ to nɔ yemi ɔ. Nɛ nɔ yemi ko be he ko nɛ pi Mawu nɛ to lɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nihi nɛ yi ma nɔ yemi mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, Mawu tue nɛ a ngɛ gboe ɔ nɛ, nɛ a maa gbla a tue. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Ejakaa polisi wui kpakpa peeli a he gbeye, se mohu nihi nɛ peeɔ yayami ɔ, mɛ ji nihi nɛ yeɔ lɛ gbeye. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ke o sume nɛ o ye gbeye ɔ, lɛɛ moo ye mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ e maa hi ha mo. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Polisi ɔ, Mawu nɛ tsɔ lɛ nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua mo. Se ke o ngɛ yayami pee ɔ, lɛɛ e sa nɛ o ye gbeye, ejakaa e ma ha nɛ a gbla o tue. Ejakaa enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu to lɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa kaa o ye mlaa amɛ a nɔ, tsa pi ngɛ tue gblami ɔ kɛkɛ he, se mohu e ji nɔ́ ko nɛ sa kaa o pee.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Nɛ e sa kaa o wo lapoo hulɔ, ejakaa e sa nɛ a wo ma ni tsuli ɔmɛ hiɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a nyɛ nɛ a tsu Mawu ni tsumi ɔ nɛ a sɔmɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Nyɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ hiɔwo bɔ nɛ sa lɛ; nyɛɛ wo lapoo ngɛ bua jɔmi mi. Nyɛɛ bu nihi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ nɔ yee ɔ. Nɛ nihi nɛ sa hɛ mi nyami ɔ, nyɛɛ wo a hɛ mi nyami nɛ nyɛɛ bu mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Nyɛɛ wo nyɛ he hiɔhi tsuo, nɛ nyɛ ko hɛɛ nɔ ko hiɔ. Nɛ nyɛ kpɛti suɔmi ɔ se nɛ ko po. Ejakaa nɔ nɛ suɔ e nyɛmi ɔ, e yeɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ tsuo a nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ejakaa ke o suɔ o nyɛmi kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mo nitsɛ o he ɔ, o be suɔe nɛ o ye lɛ awi aloo nɛ o sisi lɛ, aloo o gbe lɛ aloo o ju e nɔ́ ko. Nɛ o be suɔe nɛ o kɛ e yo nɛ bɔ ajuama aloo o hɛ nɛ kɔ e nɔ́ ko nɔ, aloo nɛ o pee nɔ́ kpa ko nɛ Mlaa Nyɔngma amɛ tsɔɔ kaa e hí ɔ. Nɛ Mlaa Nyɔngma amɛ tsuo hɔɔ si ngɛ kake nɛ ɔ mi, kaa o suɔ o nyɛmi kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mo nitsɛ o he ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Suɔmi pee we nɔ ko yayami, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ suɔmi ye Mawu Mlaa amɛ tsuo a nɔ ɔ nɛ. Lɔ ɔ pɛ ji mlaa nɛ he hia mo.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Nɔ́ nɛ he je hu nɛ e sa kaa nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi nɛ hi ngɛ ji, Nutsɔ ɔ bami be ɔ na wɔ ta. Nyɛɛ te si kɛ je mahe mi, ejakaa wa yi wami hemi be ɔ na wɔ pe kekle be nɛ wa he ye ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12-13" />Nyɔ ɔ be ta, nɛ wa yi wami hemi be ɔ su ta. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ngmɛɛ diblii mi ni yayahi a tsumi ɔmɛ a he nɛ nyɛɛ wo si himi kpakpa tade ɔ kaa piani bimɛ. Nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi bɔ nɛ sa, nɛ nyɛɛ ye anɔkuale ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ mi. Nyɛ ko puɛ nyɛ be ngɛ yakayaka fiɛmi kɛ da demi mi, aloo ngɛ ajuama bɔmi kɛ hɛ kɔmi, aloo pɛ kɛ hunga jemi mi. <verse eid="ROM 13:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Se mohu nyɛ bi Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɛ e ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi bɔ nɛ sa, nɛ nyɛ ko di yayami peemi se.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ ko kojo nyɛ he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Nyɛmi nɛ e hemi kɛ yemi gbɔjɔ ɔ, nyɛ he lɛ atuu kɛ wo nyɛ kpɛti, nɛ nyɛ ko kojo lɛ ngɛ e ni peemi níhi a he. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Nɔ ko hemi kɛ yemi haa lɛ he blɔ nɛ e yeɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, se nɔ nɛ e hemi kɛ yemi gbɔjɔ ɔ, lɛɛ ba pɛ e yeɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ nɛ yeɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ɔ, e ko gbe nɔ nɛ yi ɔ he guɛ. Nɛ nɔ nɛ yeɔ ba hu ɔ, e ko kojo nɔ nɛ yeɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ɔ, ejakaa Mawu bimɛ ji mɛ tsuo. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Jamɛ a ni ɔmɛ ɔ, Mawu sɔmɔli ji mɛ, tsa pi mo o nihi ji mɛ; ja he je ɔ, o be he blɔ nɛ o kojoɔ mɛ. Moo lɛɛ moo ngmɛɛ nɔ nɛ yeɔ a nɔ ɔ he nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ nɔ́ nɛ da kɛ nɔ́ nɛ dɛ; ejakaa Mawu ngɛ he wami nɛ e haa nɛ a peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ sa kaa a pee.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Ni komɛ susu kaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a he jɔɔmi ligbi ɔmɛ ji be titli komɛ a nɔ nɛ e sa kaa a ja Mawu, nɛ ni komɛ hu deɔ ke e sɛ kaa a peeɔ ja, ejakaa Mawu ngɛ he wami ngɛ ligbi fɛɛ ligbi nɔ. Ma suɔ nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e pee lɛ nitsɛ e juɛmi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Ke nyɛ ngɛ ligbi titli komɛ a nɔ nɛ nyɛ jaa Mawu ɔ, lɛɛ e hɛ mi nyami nɛ nyɛ ngɛ woe; nɛ e ji nɔ́ kpakpa nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pee. Ja a nɔuu kɛ nɛ nɔ ko nɛ yeɔ wɔ nya lo ɔ hu naa Nutsɔ ɔ si, nɛ e ji nɔ́ nɛ da. Nɛ nɔ nɛ yi wɔ nya lo ɔ hu woɔ Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi nyami nɛ e naa lɛ si. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Wa ti nɔ ko be lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ he wami nɛ e ma de ke e maa hi je mi aloo e ma gbo. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Wami mi jio, gbenɔ mi jio, Nutsɔ ɔ bimɛ ji wɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Kristo gbo nɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje ngɛ konɛ e pee wa Nutsɔ ngɛ wa wami kɛ gbenɔ mi.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Moo lɛɛ o be he blɔ nɛ o kojoɔ o nyɛmi aloo o gbee e he guɛ. Nyɛ kai kaa wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa da Mawu Kojomi Sɛ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Ejakaa a ngma ke, Nutsɔ ɔ de ke, “Si abɔ nɛ ye hɛ ngɛ nɛ ɔ, nakutso fɛɛ nakutso ma kpla si ha mi nɛ lilɛ fɛɛ lilɛ maa jaje e he yayami kɛ tsɔɔ Mawu.” <verse eid="ROM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa bu lɛ nitsɛ e he akɔtaa kɛ ha Mawu. <verse eid="ROM 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ja a he je ɔ, nyɛ kpa nyɛ he kojomi. Se mohu nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi saminya bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ nɔ ko susu kaa e hí ɔ, e ko na mo nɛ o ngɛ pee.<verse eid="ROM 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Ami lɛɛ i he ye ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu he wami nya kaa ke nɔ ko ye lohwe nɛ a gbe kɛ ha wɔhi ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ ɔ pee we tɔmi. Se ke nɔ ko he ye kaa e peeɔ tɔmi ɔ, lɛɛ e ko ye, ejakaa e maa pee tɔmi ha lɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Nɛ ke o niye ni haoɔ o nyɛmi se o kpa we yemi ɔ, lɛɛ o bɛ o je mi ngɛ suɔmi mi. Mo ko ha nɛ o nya ngma nɛ o yeɔ ɔ nɛ e tɔtɔ nɔ ko nɛ Kristo gbo ha lɛ ɔ nane. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ke kpakpa nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pee po ɔ, nyɛɛ pee bɔ nɛ a be nyɛ he munyu tue. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ejakaa tsa pi ni yemi kɛ ni numi nɛ peeɔ wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli, se mohu kpakpa peemi, he jɔmi kɛ bua jɔmi nɛ wa naa kɛ jee Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ke nyɛ ha he blɔ nɛ Kristo ye nyɛ nɔ matsɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, Mawu bua maa jɔ nyɛ he, nɛ nihi hu maa suɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ja a he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ waa di kake peemi se, nɛ waa ye kɛ bua wa nyɛmimɛ nɛ a nane nɛ pi si ngɛ asafo ɔ mi.<verse eid="ROM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Nyɛ ko puɛ Mawu ni tsumi ɔ ngɛ lo kpɔ kake loo nya ngma he. Nyɛ kai kaa tɔmi ko be jamɛ a lo ɔ loo niye ni ɔ he, se e ji tɔmi kɛ ha nɔ nɛ yeɔ nɛ e kɛ tɔtɔɔ nɔ ko nane ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />E hi kaa o ko ye lo aloo o ko nu wai aloo o ko pee nɔ́ ko nɛ e hí kɛ ha o nyɛmi, aloo e maa tɔtɔ e nane.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ke o le kaa nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ pee ɔ pi nɔ́ yaya ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi tete ɔ, mo ko je kpo kɛ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ e maa hao mɛ ɔ. A jɔɔ nɔ nɛ e kpakpa peemi ya pee we yayami kɛ ha we nɔ kpa. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ yeɔ kaa nɔ́ nɛ e ngɛ hlae nɛ e pee ɔ e dɛ ɔ, e ko pee. E peeɔ yayami kɛ ha lɛ ke ji e pee, ejakaa e susu kaa e dɛ. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ e maa pee nɛ pi nɔ́ nɛ e susu kaa e da a, e ji yayami.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />E sa kaa wɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi pi si ɔ, waa ye kɛ bua ni nɛmɛ nɛ a gbɔjɔ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi mi ɔ, nɛ wa ko susu wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa bua jɔmi nami he tsɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ di e nyɛmi kpakpa peemi se, konɛ e ye ke bua lɛ nɛ e pi si ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Ejakaa Kristo susuu we lɛ nitsɛ e he kaa bɔ nɛ Latsɛ ɔ de ke, “E ba kɛ ha nɔ́ nami, nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ sume Nutsɔ ɔ bɔ lɛ ahlua.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />A ngma ni nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi kɛ je blema kɛ fɔ si nɛ a kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ ni bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa na tsui si tomi kɛ bua womi kɛ hyɛ be nɛ Mawu maa ye yayami kɛ gbenɔ nɔ kunimi ɔ blɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Mawu nɔ nɛ haa nɔ tsui si tomi kɛ bua womi kɛ he wami womi ɔ nɛ ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ kake peemi nɛ hi nyɛ kpɛti kaa Kristo se nyɛɛli. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, wɔ tsuo wa ma nyɛ ma wo gbi kake kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ yi kɛ wo Mawu nɛ ji wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo Tsɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami. Ma je li ɔmɛ hu ma nya<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Ja a he je ɔ, nyɛ he nyɛ he atuu kaa nyɛmimɛ kɛ wo asafo ɔ mi, kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo hu he nyɛ atuu ɔ, konɛ nyɛ kɛ wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Nyɛ kai kaa Yesu Kristo ba nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ e kɛ tsɔɔ kaa si nɛ Mawu wo wa tsɛ ɔmɛ ɔ anɔkuale i. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Nɛ nyɛ kai hu kaa Yesu Kristo ba, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a he ma je li ɔmɛ a yi wami konɛ a wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami ngɛ e mɔbɔ nami ɔ he. Nɛ enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ La polɔ ɔ ngɛ tsɔɔe be nɛ e de ke, “Ma je o yi ngɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a kpɛti, nɛ ma la kɛ je o biɛ ɔ yi.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Nɛ e de ngɛ he kpa ko hu ke, “Nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ nitsɛ e ni ɔmɛ nɛ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ nya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />E de ekohu ke, “Nyɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ yi, nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ, nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ je e yi.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Nɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia de ke, “Matsɛ bi ko maa je Isai weku ɔ mi kɛ ba, nɛ e ma ba ye ma je li ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ matsɛ, nɛ a maa ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ lɛ pɛ e nɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ sɔlee ha nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ kaa Mawu nɔ nɛ haa nɔ hɛ nɔ kami ɔ, e ha nyɛ bua jɔmi kɛ he jɔmi babauu nɛ nyɛ he e nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye. Nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee hu kaa Mawu nɛ ye ke bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛ na hemi kɛ yemi babauu ngɛ e mi kɛ gu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ he wami nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Mamimɛ, i le kaa kpakpa peemi hyi nyɛ tɔ, nɛ nyɛ le ni nɛ ɔmɛ a mi fitsofitso, nɛ nyɛ tsɔɔ ni kpahi hulɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Se kɛ ɔ, i wo ka kɛ ti nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a mi kɛ ha nyɛ, ejakaa i he ye kaa ni nɛ ɔmɛ ji kaimi nihi nɛ he hia nyɛ, ngɛ dloomi nɛ Mawu kɛ dloo mi ɔ he; <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />kaa imi ji tsɔlɔ pɔtɛɛ nɛ Yesu Kristo tsɔ ma jeli ɔmɛ a ngɔ kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ pee bɔ sami nɔ́ nɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi. Ejakaa a tsukɔ nyɛ he kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa kaa i fiaa ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ Yesu Kristo tsu kɛ gu ye nɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />I be he blɔ nɛ i kojoɔ ni tsumi nɛ e tsu kɛ gu ni kpahi a nɔ ɔ, se i ngɛ nɔ mi mami kaa e gu ye nɔ kɛ kpɔ ma je li ɔmɛ kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />I kpɔ mɛ kɛ gu ye fiɛmi kɛ si himi kpakpa nɛ i hi ngɛ a kpɛti nɔ, kɛ nyakpɛ níhi nɛ a tsu kɛ gu ye nɔ, kaa okadihi nɛ je Mawu ngɔ ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he wami nya. Kɛ gu blɔ nɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, i fiɛ Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ bɔle si, kɛ je Yerusalem nɛ i ya gbe nya ngɛ Ilirikum.<verse eid="ROM 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Se ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ tsuo a mi ɔ, ye suɔmi ji kaa ma tsa nɔ nɛ ma fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ ya he nɛ a wui Kristo biɛ ɔ ta ngɛ, se pi he nɛ nɔ ko je asafo ɔ sisi ngɛ momo. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />I kɛ nɔ́ nɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia de ɔ to ye hɛ mi, kaa nihi nɛ a jaje we Kristo he munyu kɛ tsɔɔ we mɛ ɔ, a maa na, nɛ a maa nu sisi. <verse eid="ROM 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Enɛ ɔ nɛ tsi mi blɔ nɛ i ba slaa we nyɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i gbe ye ni tsumi ɔ nya ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ i pee ye juɛmi jeha babauu ji nɛ ɔ, i dla ye he nɛ ma ba nyɛ ngɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Ejakaa i to nɛ ma hia blɔ kɛ ya Spania; nɛ i ma suɔ nɛ ma gu nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ Roma, nɛ i kɛ nyɛ nɛ ba na bua jɔmi bɔɔ loko nyɛ ya je mi blɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo se nyɛɛli a yemi kɛ buami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Se loko ma ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, i kɛ nike ni ko yaa ha Yudea Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ Yerusalem lolo. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ejakaa Makedonia kɛ Akaia asafo ɔmɛ tsu onia kɛ yaa ha Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ fimi mi ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />A pee enɛ ɔ kɛ bua jɔmi, ejakaa mɛ nitsɛmɛ a na kaa a hɛɛ Yerusalem asafo ɔ hiɔ. Ejakaa Yerusalem asafo ɔ mi nɛ Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ je kɛ ba su mɛ ma je li ɔmɛ. Akɛnɛ a nine su kikɛmɛ a Manye Munyu ɔ nike ni nɛ ɔ nɔ kɛ je a ngɔ he je ɔ, a na kaa e sa nɛ mɛ hu a yeɔ kɛ buaa mɛ kɛ he lo nya nike ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ja a he je ɔ, ke i kɛ a sika a ya ha mɛ nɛ i gbe kikɛmɛ a ni tsumi kpakpa nɛ ɔ nya a, i ma ba gu nyɛ ngɔ kɛ ho Spania ya. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Nɛ i le kaa ke i ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ maa jɔɔ nyɛ babauu kɛ gu ye nɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />I ngɛ nyɛ bie ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo he je, ke suɔmi nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ suɔ mi ɔ he, kaa nyɛɛ piɛ ye he kɛ sɔle ha Mawu nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi ngɛ ye ni tsumi ɔ mi. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Nyɛɛ sɔle konɛ a bu ye he ngɛ nihi nɛ he we Kristo yi ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ a he. Nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle hu kaa Yerusalem asafo ɔ nɛ he sika a nɛ i kɛ yaa ha mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Konɛ ke Mawu maa suɔ ɔ, ma ba nyɛ ngɔ kɛ bua jɔmi, nɛ waa wo wa bi a bua.<verse eid="ROM 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />He jɔmi Mawu ɔ kɛ nyɛ nɛ hi si saminya. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Sɛ manemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Foibe nɛ ji wa suɔlɔ nyɛmiyo nɛ je Kenkrea asafo ɔ mi ɔ ma nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ be kpiti mi. E gbo hiɛ ɔ asafo ɔ he dengme. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Nyɛ he lɛ atuu kaa nyɛ nyɛmiyo ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi; nɛ nyɛɛ pee lɛ nubwɔ kaa bɔ nɛ sa Kristo asafo bimɛ. Nɛ nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua lɛ ngɛ blɔ tsuaa blɔ nɔ, ejakaa lɛ hu e ye kɛ bua ami nitsɛ kɛ nihi fuu ngɛ haomihi a mi. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Nyɛ nga Priska kɛ Akuila, ye huɛmɛ nɛ i kɛ mɛ tsuɔ ni ngɛ Yesu Kristo mi ɔ ha mi. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Anɔkuale ji kaa a kɛ a wami sã bɔ ngɛ ye he; nɛ tsa pi ami kɛkɛ nɛ i ngɛ mɛ si nae ɔ, se ma je li ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ a mi tsuo ngɛ mɛ si nae.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Nyɛ nga nihi tsuo nɛ kpee nɛ a jaa Mawu ngɛ a wehi a mi ɔ ha mi. Nyɛ nga ye huɛ kpakpa Epaineto nɛ ji kekle Asia no nɛ kɛ e he ha Kristo ɔ ha mi. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Nyɛ nga Maria nɔ nɛ gbo wa he dengme ɔ hu ha mi. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ nga Androniko kɛ Yunia nɛ ji ye wekuli nɛ a wo i kɛ mɛ tsu mi ɔ ha mi. A he biɛ ngɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ a kpɛti, nɛ a kɛ a he ha Kristo loko i fie a se. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Nyɛ nga Ampliato, nɔ nɛ i suɔ lɛ kaa Mawu nitsɛ bi ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ɔ, <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />kɛ Urbano, wa huɛ nɛ waa kɛ lɛ tsuɔ ni ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ, kɛ suɔlɔ Staki.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Nyɛ nga Apele, nɔmlɔ kpakpa nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ je ha mi ɔ. Nɛ nyɛ nga nihi nɛ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ Aristobulo we ɔ mi ɔ hulɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Nyɛ kai nɛ nyɛ nga ye weku no Herodion kɛ Kristo sɔmɔli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Narkiso we ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Nyɛ nga Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsuli nɛ ji Trifaina kɛ Trifosa kɛ suɔlɔ kpakpa Persi nɛ tsu ni wawɛɛ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Nyɛ nga Rufo, nɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hla kaa e pee lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ ɔ, kɛ e nyɛ nɛ ngɔ mi kɛ pee lɛ nitsɛ e bi ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />I kɛ pɛɛ kpami ngɛ nyɛ hɛ mi fɔe nɛ nyɛ nga Asinkrito, Felgon, Herma, Patroba, Herme kɛ nyɛmimɛ nɛ kɛ mɛ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Nyɛ nga Filologo, Yulia, Nerea kɛ e nyɛmiyo ɔ kɛ Olimpa kɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ kɛ mɛ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Nyɛɛ ta nyɛ bi a dɛ mi nɛ nyɛ nga nyɛ he kɛ suɔmi. Kristo asafo ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ biɔ nyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nɔ́ kake nɛ ngɛ ye nya nɛ ma de loko ma gbe womi nɛ ɔ nya ji, nyɛɛ kɛ nihi nɛ kɛ mi gbamihi baa, nɛ ha nihi a hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ tɔtɔe, kɛ nihi nɛ a ni tsɔɔmi ɔmɛ je ekpa ngɛ Kristo he sane ɔ nɛ nyɛ kase ɔmɛ he ɔ nɛ ko bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Kikɛmɛ a tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, tsa pi wa Nutsɔ Yesu ni tsumi nɛ a ngɛ tsue, se mohu mɛ nitsɛmɛ a se nami he ni nɛ a ngɛ tsue. A nya mi ngɔɔ dɔkɔdɔkɔ, nɛ a nyɛɔ mlɔɔ nihi nɛ a juɛmi se ti we ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ le kaa nyɛ buɔ tue nɛ nyɛ yeɔ anɔkuale; nɛ enɛ ɔ peeɔ mi bua jɔmi saminya. Ja a he je ɔ, ma suɔ nɛ nyɛɛ nyɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ da se, nɛ nyɛɛ hiɔ yayami. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />E be kɛe nɛ he jɔmi Mawu ɔ maa naa Abosiami nɔ kɛ wo nyɛ nane si nɛ e maa wɛɛ lɛ bɔdɔbɔdɔ. Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo jɔɔmi ɔ kɛ nyɛ nɛ hi si.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoteo, ye huɛ nɛ i kɛ lɛ tsuɔ ni kɛ ye wekuli Lukio kɛ Yason kɛ Sosipatre biɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Ami Tortio, nɛ ngɛ nyɛ womi nɛ ɔ ngmae ngɛ Paulo biɛ mi ɔ hu biɔ nyɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gaio, nɔ nɛ i ngɛ e ngɔ nɛ i kɛ asafo ɔ kpee ngɛ e we ɔ mi ɔ biɔ nyɛ. Erasto nɛ ji ma sika tolɔ ɔ, kɛ wa nyɛmi Kuarto hu biɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Nyɛɛ hi si saminya. Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dloomi ɔ kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ hi si.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Mawu! Lɛ e ma nyɛ ha nyɛɛ da si kpɛii ngɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi, ngɛ Yesu Kristo he Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ i fiɛ ɔ nya, kɛ anɔkuale nyakpɛ sane nɛ a ngɔ laa yi nɔhi babauu ngɛ blema be ɔ mi, se a je lɛ kpo ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Jehanɛ ɔ, a je jamɛ a anɔkuale sane ɔ kpo paa kɛ gu gbali ɔmɛ a ngmami ɔmɛ a nɔ. Nɛ ngɛ neneene Mawu ɔ kita nya a, a ha nɛ je ɔ tsuo le, konɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ na hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Kristo mi nɛ a bu lɛ tue. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Mawu, nɔ nɛ lɛ ji ni lelɔ kake too ɔ, kɛ gu Yesu Kristo, wa Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>